(298070, 21021, 7778, '<td valign="top">Topical, perhaps an iota too much so. The stroke, however, is fluid and natural with a near 3-D appearance. The colours are not only secondary but also complimentary in an organic sort of way. The ample white space appropiately suggests a canvas.<br/> <br/>The fact that the embossed brush size is slightly out of focus introduces a tiny imperfection, most welcome here.  &gt; 6</td>', 'Topical, perhaps an iota too much so. The stroke, however, is fluid and natural with a near 3-D appearance. The colours are not only secondary but also complimentary in an organic sort of way. The ample white space appropiately suggests a canvas. The fact that the embossed brush size is slightly out of focus introduces a tiny imperfection, most welcome here.  > 6', '2003-05-14 15:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
