(298132, 21350, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice idea, i think i may have cropped the image at the top in order to avoid the empty space that is created by the water</td>', 'nice idea, i think i may have cropped the image at the top in order to avoid the empty space that is created by the water', '2003-05-14 15:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(298134, 21479, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Good clarity and nice composition.   I like the different objects that you used to show this as well.  Very good idea.</td>', 'Nice image. Good clarity and nice composition.   I like the different objects that you used to show this as well.  Very good idea.', '2003-05-14 15:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
