(298137, 21358, 6451, '<td valign="top">Cool image.  I like the way the imageis shot.  I also think that the shininess of the ball adds to describe the texture of the object in the image.</td>', 'Cool image.  I like the way the imageis shot.  I also think that the shininess of the ball adds to describe the texture of the object in the image.', '2003-05-14 15:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(298139, 21358, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice image, meets the challenge, i like the lighting</td>', 'nice image, meets the challenge, i like the lighting', '2003-05-14 15:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(298140, 21137, 7778, '<td valign="top">I''m rating this shot, coz I fear I may not do very well here. Yes, the sky is a lil washed out. Yes, the shot was taken at or near mid day and is overly ''sunny''. Yes, the choice of subject does not reflect any preferences for ''slick artificiality'', nor is it in any way spectacular. <br/> <br/>Yet, it portrays a disappearing idyll in an appropiately ''common'' way, without any ''affect''. I commend the photographer for awarding us this rare pleasure.</td>', 'I''m rating this shot, coz I fear I may not do very well here. Yes, the sky is a lil washed out. Yes, the shot was taken at or near mid day and is overly ''sunny''. Yes, the choice of subject does not reflect any preferences for ''slick artificiality'', nor is it in any way spectacular.  Yet, it portrays a disappearing idyll in an appropiately ''common'' way, without any ''affect''. I commend the photographer for awarding us this rare pleasure.', '2003-05-14 15:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(298141, 21072, 772, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2003-05-14 15:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
