(298323, 21299, 7758, '<td valign="top">Hi, I think you were really on the right track here..... but if you had either, moved around the other side of the water or come back when you weren''t shooting into the sun this would have been a much, much better shot. Good luck, Todd.</td>', 'Hi, I think you were really on the right track here..... but if you had either, moved around the other side of the water or come back when you weren''t shooting into the sun this would have been a much, much better shot. Good luck, Todd.', '2003-05-14 18:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
