(298364, 21478, 5391, '<td valign="top">The white blown out spots take this from being an excellent shot to attracting attention to the imperfections.  I would take it at a lower exposure to get everything in the shot, and then bump up the levels in Photoshop to achieve overall good exposure - or use a soft light source for the image.</td>', 'The white blown out spots take this from being an excellent shot to attracting attention to the imperfections.  I would take it at a lower exposure to get everything in the shot, and then bump up the levels in Photoshop to achieve overall good exposure - or use a soft light source for the image.', '2003-05-14 19:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
