(298510, 21334, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great colours.  I really like the top half of this photo, but I''m not too sure about the bottom.</td>', 'Great colours.  I really like the top half of this photo, but I''m not too sure about the bottom.', '2003-05-14 22:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
