(298548, 21438, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. IMO the light is a little harsh and would have been better if the light was toned down a bit. I do like the starburst effect.   Also, for composition, I would have cropped a bit on the left and bottom so the light was not so central.</td>', 'Interesting idea. IMO the light is a little harsh and would have been better if the light was toned down a bit. I do like the starburst effect.   Also, for composition, I would have cropped a bit on the left and bottom so the light was not so central.', '2003-05-14 23:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(298549, 21294, 7885, '<td valign="top">It''s the one on the right, mate.</td>', 'It''s the one on the right, mate.', '2003-05-14 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(298550, 21476, 7743, '<td valign="top">The bright orange in the background draws the viewer''s eye event though the cone in front is the one in focus.  I think this takes away from the impact of the image.  Composition and exposure seem to be otherwise ok.</td>', 'The bright orange in the background draws the viewer''s eye event though the cone in front is the one in focus.  I think this takes away from the impact of the image.  Composition and exposure seem to be otherwise ok.', '2003-05-14 23:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(298552, 21094, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the path and the trees.  The green is very vivid.  The exposure and composition look good.  IMO though it doesn''t have much in the way of impact.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the path and the trees.  The green is very vivid.  The exposure and composition look good.  IMO though it doesn''t have much in the way of impact.', '2003-05-14 23:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(298553, 20883, 7743, '<td valign="top">Exposure seems good.  For composition and impact I would have shown more of the path leading to the hut leading the viewer into the image.</td>', 'Exposure seems good.  For composition and impact I would have shown more of the path leading to the hut leading the viewer into the image.', '2003-05-14 23:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
