(298565, 21410, 7743, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling of 3-D from this image.  The exposure is good but somehow the composition doesn''t seem to work for me.  Maybe a different vantage point would have helped.</td>', 'I get the feeling of 3-D from this image.  The exposure is good but somehow the composition doesn''t seem to work for me.  Maybe a different vantage point would have helped.', '2003-05-14 23:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
