(298569, 21119, 7743, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that  this is a small portion of a much larger picture.  The colour is very strong and catches the viewer''s attention.  In order to rate this image on exposure and composition I would need to see it larger.  Look at the tutorials.  I believe there is one on resizing images to make them bigger.</td>', 'I get the feeling that  this is a small portion of a much larger picture.  The colour is very strong and catches the viewer''s attention.  In order to rate this image on exposure and composition I would need to see it larger.  Look at the tutorials.  I believe there is one on resizing images to make them bigger.', '2003-05-14 23:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
