(298579, 21389, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the dog.  He is well exposed and composed within the image.  Good action portrayal.</td>', 'Nice shot of the dog.  He is well exposed and composed within the image.  Good action portrayal.', '2003-05-14 23:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(298582, 20937, 7743, '<td valign="top">The orange flower holds it''s own.  It is very sharp and well exposed.   I think this image would work much better if the pink flower were cropped out.</td>', 'The orange flower holds it''s own.  It is very sharp and well exposed.   I think this image would work much better if the pink flower were cropped out.', '2003-05-14 23:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(298584, 21334, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice clear, sharp and well exposed purple flower.  The orange flowers are distracting since the orange is a dominant colour in this image.</td>', 'Nice clear, sharp and well exposed purple flower.  The orange flowers are distracting since the orange is a dominant colour in this image.', '2003-05-15 00:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(298585, 21292, 7743, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  You can just barely make out the tumbler giving the orange an eerie glow.</td>', 'Cool shot.  You can just barely make out the tumbler giving the orange an eerie glow.', '2003-05-15 00:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(298586, 20939, 7743, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the composition here is too busy.  The lighting is also quite harsh.</td>', 'Unfortunately the composition here is too busy.  The lighting is also quite harsh.', '2003-05-15 00:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(298588, 21373, 7743, '<td valign="top">The small purple plants in the background are distracting and take away from the impact of the soft coloured solitary tulip.  Would a different vantage point  have given a less distracting background?</td>', 'The small purple plants in the background are distracting and take away from the impact of the soft coloured solitary tulip.  Would a different vantage point  have given a less distracting background?', '2003-05-15 00:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(298590, 21499, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice effect created with the backlight.  Exposure seems good.  The only thing I might of tried would be to include more in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice effect created with the backlight.  Exposure seems good.  The only thing I might of tried would be to include more in the foreground.', '2003-05-15 00:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(298593, 20976, 7743, '<td valign="top">Wierd colouring.  It does''t look natural.</td>', 'Wierd colouring.  It does''t look natural.', '2003-05-15 00:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(298596, 21440, 8731, '<td valign="top">Awesome pic!</td>', 'Awesome pic!', '2003-05-15 00:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(298598, 21444, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach.  The match is a little overpowering for the image.</td>', 'Interesting approach.  The match is a little overpowering for the image.', '2003-05-15 00:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(298599, 21308, 7743, '<td valign="top">The lines of the quilt lead to the main subject.  The lighting is too flat though.  Something is needed to ad sparkle to the irises.</td>', 'The lines of the quilt lead to the main subject.  The lighting is too flat though.  Something is needed to ad sparkle to the irises.', '2003-05-15 00:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(298601, 21199, 7743, '<td valign="top">This looks like a painting.  I''d be very interested in seeing how you did this.</td>', 'This looks like a painting.  I''d be very interested in seeing how you did this.', '2003-05-15 00:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(298602, 21028, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is much too small an image to evaluate fairly.</td>', 'This is much too small an image to evaluate fairly.', '2003-05-15 00:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(298607, 20991, 7743, '<td valign="top">Cropping the green from the left would give this image better composition (IMO).</td>', 'Cropping the green from the left would give this image better composition (IMO).', '2003-05-15 00:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(298609, 21141, 7743, '<td valign="top">He looks like he''s smiling.  Exposure seems good.  For composition though I would have given him more space to the right and on the bottom.</td>', 'He looks like he''s smiling.  Exposure seems good.  For composition though I would have given him more space to the right and on the bottom.', '2003-05-15 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(298610, 21263, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the leading line here but the perspective feels wrong.  It might be because the horizon is needed for this image.</td>', 'I like the leading line here but the perspective feels wrong.  It might be because the horizon is needed for this image.', '2003-05-15 00:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(298611, 21246, 7743, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  Nice use of DOF.</td>', 'Cool effect.  Nice use of DOF.', '2003-05-15 00:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(298613, 21350, 7743, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the horizon is necessary in this shot so you could have cropped it  just below the whitecap in the middle.  Also, timing is everything.   More imact may have been gotten if you had clicked the shutter a split second earlier.</td>', 'I don''t think the horizon is necessary in this shot so you could have cropped it  just below the whitecap in the middle.  Also, timing is everything.   More imact may have been gotten if you had clicked the shutter a split second earlier.', '2003-05-15 00:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
