(298667, 21411, 2586, '<td valign="top">the red of the pepper is just divine; the light is great, the purple cloth is fine - although a little wrinkled. What mars it for me is the green apple. Without it, i would gone higher. 6</td>', 'the red of the pepper is just divine; the light is great, the purple cloth is fine - although a little wrinkled. What mars it for me is the green apple. Without it, i would gone higher. 6', '2003-05-15 02:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(298670, 21389, 7570, '<td valign="top">this would have turned out to be YAFP (Yet Another Fauna Photo) in this secondary colour challenge, but the attendance of your pooch adds life and character into this photo. Here''s a 6</td>', 'this would have turned out to be YAFP (Yet Another Fauna Photo) in this secondary colour challenge, but the attendance of your pooch adds life and character into this photo. Here''s a 6', '2003-05-15 02:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(298671, 21210, 7570, '<td valign="top">a little strong on Magenta.</td>', 'a little strong on Magenta.', '2003-05-15 02:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(298676, 21453, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful vibrant colors!</td>', 'Wonderful vibrant colors!', '2003-05-15 03:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(298677, 20995, 2586, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that the Rijksmuseum in the background? I have never been in a country where i have seen bicycles with quite as much character as in Holland. I like your orange city. Although there are lots of things at work here, it isn''t busy and together they make for a pleasant scene. Like how the bicycle fills the whole width and frames the city view. Now, for the CompColor challenge are you going to feature the Red Light District with a hooker in a green dress sitting behind the window? :)  8</td>', 'Isn''t that the Rijksmuseum in the background? I have never been in a country where i have seen bicycles with quite as much character as in Holland. I like your orange city. Although there are lots of things at work here, it isn''t busy and together they make for a pleasant scene. Like how the bicycle fills the whole width and frames the city view. Now, for the CompColor challenge are you going to feature the Red Light District with a hooker in a green dress sitting behind the window? :)  8', '2003-05-15 03:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(298678, 21299, 2586, '<td valign="top">My ''brain'' knows these waterlilies are beautiful but my eyes can''t quite feel it because they are too far away. The reflection of the trees in the water is very appealing and i like how the dark tree shadows frames this delicate bed of waterlilies and leaves. I''m not at all a stickler about meeting the challenge, but one might argue that these green leaves really look grey here and the lilies aren''t orange but pink :) 7</td>', 'My ''brain'' knows these waterlilies are beautiful but my eyes can''t quite feel it because they are too far away. The reflection of the trees in the water is very appealing and i like how the dark tree shadows frames this delicate bed of waterlilies and leaves. I''m not at all a stickler about meeting the challenge, but one might argue that these green leaves really look grey here and the lilies aren''t orange but pink :) 7', '2003-05-15 03:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(298680, 21425, 2586, '<td valign="top">This image has a real nice sensitivity to it. Just wishes those other flower buds (particularly the one to the left near the edge) weren''t there but you had no control over them other than vandalizing them. The light on the flower is perfect. Great detail of the various parts of the flower. Nice placement with giving the flower plenty of room to ''breathe''. The feelers are the showstopper. I must get some of these flowers if they will grow here. 9</td>', 'This image has a real nice sensitivity to it. Just wishes those other flower buds (particularly the one to the left near the edge) weren''t there but you had no control over them other than vandalizing them. The light on the flower is perfect. Great detail of the various parts of the flower. Nice placement with giving the flower plenty of room to ''breathe''. The feelers are the showstopper. I must get some of these flowers if they will grow here. 9', '2003-05-15 03:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(298683, 21309, 7570, '<td valign="top">ewww....but great idea nonetheless. tell me u didn''t let the skittles go to waste after shooting?</td>', 'ewww....but great idea nonetheless. tell me u didn''t let the skittles go to waste after shooting?', '2003-05-15 03:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
