(298686, 21490, 2923, '<td valign="top">A little bit underexposure would be better -- i''d like to see the bird in a sillhouette, right now it''s not and you can''t see the details.  Just about 1/2 stop under would allow the bird to be completely black, would be more effective. 7</td>', 'A little bit underexposure would be better -- i''d like to see the bird in a sillhouette, right now it''s not and you can''t see the details.  Just about 1/2 stop under would allow the bird to be completely black, would be more effective. 7', '2003-05-15 03:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
