(299151, 21246, 933, '<td valign="top">Wow, great image.  Great focus on the head of teh critter.  Nice job capturing it on a white background, really help to viewer focus on the subject of the photo, which is the bug.  Nice colors on his shell, and he even managed a very nice smile for the camera.  Good Job!  9 md</td>', 'Wow, great image.  Great focus on the head of teh critter.  Nice job capturing it on a white background, really help to viewer focus on the subject of the photo, which is the bug.  Nice colors on his shell, and he even managed a very nice smile for the camera.  Good Job!  9 md', '2003-05-15 14:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(299152, 21305, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Very good choice of lighting and composition.  I like the way that the light provides for shininess to the image. Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  Very good choice of lighting and composition.  I like the way that the light provides for shininess to the image. Good job.', '2003-05-15 14:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(299155, 21021, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean, simple, interesting.  I like the fact that you flipped the brush so green is on orange.  Lighting could be a little more thorough - would avoid the shadow on the left side of the brush.  Plus the focus on the brush seems just a hair off.  All in all, excellent work.  9  md</td>', 'Nice, clean, simple, interesting.  I like the fact that you flipped the brush so green is on orange.  Lighting could be a little more thorough - would avoid the shadow on the left side of the brush.  Plus the focus on the brush seems just a hair off.  All in all, excellent work.  9  md', '2003-05-15 14:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(299156, 21403, 6451, '<td valign="top">Good image.  I like the clarity of the image and the quality of the image.  The water on the object also provides a nice value and texture of the image.</td>', 'Good image.  I like the clarity of the image and the quality of the image.  The water on the object also provides a nice value and texture of the image.', '2003-05-15 14:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(299157, 21070, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and texture.  Good lightign makes this an interesting shot.  Focus seems a tad off.  Very nice work!  8 md</td>', 'Nice colors and texture.  Good lightign makes this an interesting shot.  Focus seems a tad off.  Very nice work!  8 md', '2003-05-15 14:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(299158, 21113, 6451, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this image very much. There is too much negative space and the colors are a bit bland.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'I don''t like this image very much. There is too much negative space and the colors are a bit bland.  Nice idea though.', '2003-05-15 14:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(299162, 21465, 933, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed shot.  Good lighting and nice warm colors, though they seem to lean more towards the yellow and white than the complementary colors required for the challenge.  All in all a very nice photo, good title too.  8  md</td>', 'Very nicely composed shot.  Good lighting and nice warm colors, though they seem to lean more towards the yellow and white than the complementary colors required for the challenge.  All in all a very nice photo, good title too.  8  md', '2003-05-15 14:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(299163, 21307, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Good job on the composition and clarity of the image.   Good job with the lighting as well. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Good job on the composition and clarity of the image.   Good job with the lighting as well. Good job.', '2003-05-15 14:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(299164, 21244, 6451, '<td valign="top">Yuck.  Good job with this image though. There is nice composition and value in this image, as well as the texture provided by the mold on the lemon. Good job.</td>', 'Yuck.  Good job with this image though. There is nice composition and value in this image, as well as the texture provided by the mold on the lemon. Good job.', '2003-05-15 14:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(299165, 21498, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very good image.  Good use of texture and colors. The lighting also helps make the texture stand out more.  Good job.</td>', 'Very good image.  Good use of texture and colors. The lighting also helps make the texture stand out more.  Good job.', '2003-05-15 14:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
