(299167, 21333, 933, '<td valign="top">One of the most interesting shots in this weeks challenge.  Focus does seem a tad off, and I a little unsure about the composition.  maybe rotated to a verticle orientation would be better?  Not sure...  Also, If you could have shifted the blue to orange, it might have both made more of an impact, and hit hit the challenge even more swuarely on the nose.  Still though, this is a very nice photo, and I very much like it.  Well done.  8  md</td>', 'One of the most interesting shots in this weeks challenge.  Focus does seem a tad off, and I a little unsure about the composition.  maybe rotated to a verticle orientation would be better?  Not sure...  Also, If you could have shifted the blue to orange, it might have both made more of an impact, and hit hit the challenge even more swuarely on the nose.  Still though, this is a very nice photo, and I very much like it.  Well done.  8  md', '2003-05-15 14:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(299168, 21488, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like the how you chose to use the colors.  I  think that maybe the lighting is too dark though.  It looks as if the photo was taken in a dark spot with a light shining on it and is makes the value of the image less noticable.</td>', 'Nice image.  I like the how you chose to use the colors.  I  think that maybe the lighting is too dark though.  It looks as if the photo was taken in a dark spot with a light shining on it and is makes the value of the image less noticable.', '2003-05-15 14:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(299169, 21475, 933, '<td valign="top">As you may notice from some of my photos, I''m rather fond of b&amp;w with color.  I like the rough &amp; raw feel of this.  Good character and texture.  Not too sure about the framing &amp; composition.  Maybe seeing the whole street sign would have been better.  A very nic photo, good job!   8  md</td>', 'As you may notice from some of my photos, I''m rather fond of b&w with color.  I like the rough & raw feel of this.  Good character and texture.  Not too sure about the framing & composition.  Maybe seeing the whole street sign would have been better.  A very nic photo, good job!   8  md', '2003-05-15 14:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(299170, 20938, 6451, '<td valign="top">This image has a couple of filters used on it.  If not then this image is really out of focus.</td>', 'This image has a couple of filters used on it.  If not then this image is really out of focus.', '2003-05-15 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(299176, 21156, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice composed and framed.  Clean, crisp focus.  Great lighting.  All in a an excellent photo.  9  md   -  (update)  After further review, the judges have ruled this to be a 10 instead of a 9.  5 yards, and a 1st down!     ;?)  10  md</td>', 'Nice composed and framed.  Clean, crisp focus.  Great lighting.  All in a an excellent photo.  9  md   -  (update)  After further review, the judges have ruled this to be a 10 instead of a 9.  5 yards, and a 1st down!     ;?)  10  md', '2003-05-15 14:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(299179, 21107, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  Nice ideas. . .this image looks abstract and it really catches your eye.  There is also a lot of texture and pattern in the image.  Good job.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  Nice ideas. . .this image looks abstract and it really catches your eye.  There is also a lot of texture and pattern in the image.  Good job.', '2003-05-15 14:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(299181, 21389, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  . good compostion.  I like the way that you captured the image of the dog in the air.  The image looks very interesting and the action even makes it more interesting to the viewers eye.  Good  job.</td>', 'Nice image.  . good compostion.  I like the way that you captured the image of the dog in the air.  The image looks very interesting and the action even makes it more interesting to the viewers eye.  Good  job.', '2003-05-15 15:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(299186, 21454, 4411, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. A good idea, great composition and the lighting ... superb!<br/>Great shot, well done.</td>', 'This is lovely. A good idea, great composition and the lighting ... superb!Great shot, well done.', '2003-05-15 15:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(299193, 20954, 4411, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The composition is great, but what really strikes me is the perfect DoF. The ferns are nicely blurred yet you can still see the jagged edges. Great stuff.<br/>The big spot of pollen near the center of the frame is annoying the frell out of me - did you not think to clean it off? ; )<br/>Great shot, well done.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The composition is great, but what really strikes me is the perfect DoF. The ferns are nicely blurred yet you can still see the jagged edges. Great stuff.The big spot of pollen near the center of the frame is annoying the frell out of me - did you not think to clean it off? ; )Great shot, well done.', '2003-05-15 15:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(299202, 21113, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice composition and interesting choice of frame.  the focus seems a little soft, which might have more to do with the way you lit it/post processed it to erase the background.  i think you are allowed to submit a bigger picture and you would have benefited from doing that.</td>', 'nice composition and interesting choice of frame.  the focus seems a little soft, which might have more to do with the way you lit it/post processed it to erase the background.  i think you are allowed to submit a bigger picture and you would have benefited from doing that.', '2003-05-15 15:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(299204, 21319, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice detail and color.  interesting crop, i''m not sure why you cropped it so tight, esp. at the bottom (i understand that you might not want to hve any non-flower/background in the photo, but i loks like you had room at the bottom - unless you were working on a sunrise/set type of image).</td>', 'nice detail and color.  interesting crop, i''m not sure why you cropped it so tight, esp. at the bottom (i understand that you might not want to hve any non-flower/background in the photo, but i loks like you had room at the bottom - unless you were working on a sunrise/set type of image).', '2003-05-15 15:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(299206, 21296, 3607, '<td valign="top">the rotation seems a bit off, but the larger issue is that the way the light falls its hard to discern the green color of the clothing and i have no idea what color the roof is, the plants and most of the trees aren''t showing much green either (unless of course you are indicating that this is an energy efficient house and therefore ''green'')</td>', 'the rotation seems a bit off, but the larger issue is that the way the light falls its hard to discern the green color of the clothing and i have no idea what color the roof is, the plants and most of the trees aren''t showing much green either (unless of course you are indicating that this is an energy efficient house and therefore ''green'')', '2003-05-15 15:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(299207, 21141, 3607, '<td valign="top">cool shot.  very nice detail.</td>', 'cool shot.  very nice detail.', '2003-05-15 15:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(299208, 21397, 3607, '<td valign="top">interesting composition and choice of setup.  i wonder about your light choice, however, which makes the subject almost too dark to really appreciate its green-ness.</td>', 'interesting composition and choice of setup.  i wonder about your light choice, however, which makes the subject almost too dark to really appreciate its green-ness.', '2003-05-15 15:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(299209, 21359, 3607, '<td valign="top">neat.  almost too cropped in however, and the backlight doesn''t allow you to fully see and appreciate the in focus parts in the forefront.  the color looks great.</td>', 'neat.  almost too cropped in however, and the backlight doesn''t allow you to fully see and appreciate the in focus parts in the forefront.  the color looks great.', '2003-05-15 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(299212, 21449, 3607, '<td valign="top">that would be lots of green and blue.  kind of a conventional composition and image.  it could have been made a little more powerful if you had taken the photo with the sun behind you so the trees and the house would have been equally lit (and therefore the trees in the background wouldn''t be blown out in light).</td>', 'that would be lots of green and blue.  kind of a conventional composition and image.  it could have been made a little more powerful if you had taken the photo with the sun behind you so the trees and the house would have been equally lit (and therefore the trees in the background wouldn''t be blown out in light).', '2003-05-15 15:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(299214, 21457, 3607, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot, with the bulb being framed by the (presumably) other bulbs in the background outside of the focus range.  only nit would have been the have it lit a little better, but the detail and the composition are wonderful.</td>', 'this is a great shot, with the bulb being framed by the (presumably) other bulbs in the background outside of the focus range.  only nit would have been the have it lit a little better, but the detail and the composition are wonderful.', '2003-05-15 15:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(299215, 21497, 3607, '<td valign="top">neat.  have no idea what it is, but the DOF is pretty cool, and the color is very austin powers.</td>', 'neat.  have no idea what it is, but the DOF is pretty cool, and the color is very austin powers.', '2003-05-15 15:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
