(299771, 21317, 2586, '<td valign="top">Exquisitely beautiful. There were many flower images in this challenge, some being very good, this is my favorite. <br/>Sure, it reminds me of Monet but also of Odilon Redon of whom i have seen works in pastels that had an other-wordly sensitivity and beauty.  10 <br/>Comment revised 5/15</td>', 'Exquisitely beautiful. There were many flower images in this challenge, some being very good, this is my favorite. Sure, it reminds me of Monet but also of Odilon Redon of whom i have seen works in pastels that had an other-wordly sensitivity and beauty.  10 Comment revised 5/15', '2003-05-15 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(299773, 21472, 2586, '<td valign="top">Really like this Z image. It''s fun, it''s playful, the colors are vibrant. Am having fun looking at this image. If it were up to me, would have filled up the entire picture plane with these chalks, or whatever they are, instead of showing the black background left and righ, which breaks up the rhythm a little. 8</td>', 'Really like this Z image. It''s fun, it''s playful, the colors are vibrant. Am having fun looking at this image. If it were up to me, would have filled up the entire picture plane with these chalks, or whatever they are, instead of showing the black background left and righ, which breaks up the rhythm a little. 8', '2003-05-15 23:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(299779, 21094, 2586, '<td valign="top">Find this image very pleasant to contemplate. Even though the greens are fairly intense, this picture reads ''peaceful''. Nice warm tones in the red/greens, particularly first tree to the right. The path leads my eye right to the intense green shrubs beyond the bend. 9</td>', 'Find this image very pleasant to contemplate. Even though the greens are fairly intense, this picture reads ''peaceful''. Nice warm tones in the red/greens, particularly first tree to the right. The path leads my eye right to the intense green shrubs beyond the bend. 9', '2003-05-15 23:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(299782, 21424, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like the vibrancy achieved here. Nice intense colors, greatly helped by the presence of the black. 8</td>', 'Like the vibrancy achieved here. Nice intense colors, greatly helped by the presence of the black. 8', '2003-05-15 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(299789, 21235, 7743, '<td valign="top">Forget the reflection, I like the rows of orange in the background.  Cropping just below the green strip  and keeping what''s above it would give this image loads of impact.</td>', 'Forget the reflection, I like the rows of orange in the background.  Cropping just below the green strip  and keeping what''s above it would give this image loads of impact.', '2003-05-16 00:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(299792, 21400, 7743, '<td valign="top">I think this image would work better if it were rotated 180 degrees.</td>', 'I think this image would work better if it were rotated 180 degrees.', '2003-05-16 00:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(299794, 21278, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  Love the softness of the pastel color choices.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  Love the softness of the pastel color choices.  Nicely done!', '2003-05-16 00:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(299795, 21137, 2586, '<td valign="top">Love the peacefulness this image exudes. The horses are fine and placed so well in the composition, the greens and yellows nicely muted. The sky could be a tad more saturated. Suspect you spend a lot of time sitting on that hill contemplating this setting and i would understand why. 9</td>', 'Love the peacefulness this image exudes. The horses are fine and placed so well in the composition, the greens and yellows nicely muted. The sky could be a tad more saturated. Suspect you spend a lot of time sitting on that hill contemplating this setting and i would understand why. 9', '2003-05-16 00:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(299797, 21424, 6600, '<td valign="top">WOW!  So clear, sharp, and colorful.  Great composition.  Super job!</td>', 'WOW!  So clear, sharp, and colorful.  Great composition.  Super job!', '2003-05-16 00:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(299799, 21409, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is fun. Are you the one perhaps behind all these color challenges? From looking at this, one might say color theory is your thing :) Well done and creative thinking. The lighting on the background is rather uneven. 8</td>', 'This is fun. Are you the one perhaps behind all these color challenges? From looking at this, one might say color theory is your thing :) Well done and creative thinking. The lighting on the background is rather uneven. 8', '2003-05-16 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(299801, 20882, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, clear, and detailed!  Great composition as well.  Super job!</td>', 'Very sharp, clear, and detailed!  Great composition as well.  Super job!', '2003-05-16 00:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(299803, 21320, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and contrast, neat effect.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice color and contrast, neat effect.  Nicely done.', '2003-05-16 00:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(299805, 21352, 6600, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!  Great composition and colors.  Very nicely done!!!</td>', 'Love this shot!  Great composition and colors.  Very nicely done!!!', '2003-05-16 00:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(299807, 21452, 2586, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. It''s just fascinating to see the intensity and concentration on the faces of the participants. Obviously, no one was posing here for you to make your shot and hence a difficult situation. You controlled it very well. And there is none of that ''too bad about such and such'' that you might expect if someone less skillful had taken this. Btw, it''s also a radical departure from most submissions here this week and that is appreciated also. 9</td>', 'I like this image a lot. It''s just fascinating to see the intensity and concentration on the faces of the participants. Obviously, no one was posing here for you to make your shot and hence a difficult situation. You controlled it very well. And there is none of that ''too bad about such and such'' that you might expect if someone less skillful had taken this. Btw, it''s also a radical departure from most submissions here this week and that is appreciated also. 9', '2003-05-16 00:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(299811, 20852, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very neat effect!  Nice colors.  (What is it?)</td>', 'Very neat effect!  Nice colors.  (What is it?)', '2003-05-16 00:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(299813, 21078, 2586, '<td valign="top">Simple, fun, effective. Even though it is a set up shot with limited props, it does say Mardi Gras. Nice vibrant colors, those silks and glitters help.  Good composition. 8</td>', 'Simple, fun, effective. Even though it is a set up shot with limited props, it does say Mardi Gras. Nice vibrant colors, those silks and glitters help.  Good composition. 8', '2003-05-16 00:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(299814, 21301, 6600, '<td valign="top">One of the better flower pics!  Nice soft colors, good composition.</td>', 'One of the better flower pics!  Nice soft colors, good composition.', '2003-05-16 00:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(299815, 21097, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image, good composition, nice colors, good treatment of the glass. This image says Party. 8</td>', 'Nice clean image, good composition, nice colors, good treatment of the glass. This image says Party. 8', '2003-05-16 00:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(299817, 20954, 6600, '<td valign="top">One of the better composed flower pics. Nice colors, but maybe a tad over-sharpened?</td>', 'One of the better composed flower pics. Nice colors, but maybe a tad over-sharpened?', '2003-05-16 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(299823, 21392, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great composition!  Colors appear right on.  Super job!</td>', 'Great composition!  Colors appear right on.  Super job!', '2003-05-16 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(299826, 21078, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice color, sharpness, and idea.</td>', 'Nice color, sharpness, and idea.', '2003-05-16 00:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(299842, 21294, 6202, '<td valign="top">Unless I am mistaken this is the same snake that I went back to coment on a few weeks ago.  Definately a beautiful snake and a very nice approach to the challenge.  I can''t believe I am sitting here again saying how nice the snake looks when I have such a fear of them and yet this snake is simply stunning and worth commenting on repeatedly.  Worth an 8.5 but since that isn''t an option hows a 9? =o)</td>', 'Unless I am mistaken this is the same snake that I went back to coment on a few weeks ago.  Definately a beautiful snake and a very nice approach to the challenge.  I can''t believe I am sitting here again saying how nice the snake looks when I have such a fear of them and yet this snake is simply stunning and worth commenting on repeatedly.  Worth an 8.5 but since that isn''t an option hows a 9? =o)', '2003-05-16 01:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(299843, 21478, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like this image of a pepper. Unique composiiton and lighting from the bottom.</td>', 'I like this image of a pepper. Unique composiiton and lighting from the bottom.', '2003-05-16 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(299844, 21165, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very pretty display of all 3 secondary colors.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very pretty display of all 3 secondary colors.  Nicely done.', '2003-05-16 01:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(299845, 21313, 6803, '<td valign="top">looks a little more blue to me</td>', 'looks a little more blue to me', '2003-05-16 01:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(299846, 21478, 6803, '<td valign="top">nice =8</td>', 'nice =8', '2003-05-16 01:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(299847, 21416, 6202, '<td valign="top">Stunning flower, I can only wonder how well it would have done in the flora challenge but even in this challenge it meets it extremely well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Stunning flower, I can only wonder how well it would have done in the flora challenge but even in this challenge it meets it extremely well.  Nicely done.', '2003-05-16 01:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(299848, 21468, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good orange image. Like the different shades. The glare in the upper left does not enhance the otherwise very good execution, IMO.</td>', 'Good orange image. Like the different shades. The glare in the upper left does not enhance the otherwise very good execution, IMO.', '2003-05-16 01:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
