(300058, 20852, 675, '<td valign="top">yeah the colors meet the challenge, the composition is okay, but the focus is off.  perhaps this is the camera or a lack of available light that made this more difficult, but it is too blurred for my taste. 3</td>', 'yeah the colors meet the challenge, the composition is okay, but the focus is off.  perhaps this is the camera or a lack of available light that made this more difficult, but it is too blurred for my taste. 3', '2003-05-16 11:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
