(300075, 21377, 675, '<td valign="top">photo seems a bit small? maybe not the full 640 pixels.  anyway the shot is nicely composed. the horizon is tilted a tad but isn''t a big issue.  the colors are nice, and you meet the challenge there. it would just be nicer to see a larger version. 5</td>', 'photo seems a bit small? maybe not the full 640 pixels.  anyway the shot is nicely composed. the horizon is tilted a tad but isn''t a big issue.  the colors are nice, and you meet the challenge there. it would just be nicer to see a larger version. 5', '2003-05-16 11:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
