(300078, 21440, 675, '<td valign="top">this photo is tilted. i''m getting dizzy right now. this is a nice capture you have here, however it is slightly over exposed which takes away from some of the sharpness you could have had.  not a terrible photo by any means but not a contender either.  5</td>', 'this photo is tilted. i''m getting dizzy right now. this is a nice capture you have here, however it is slightly over exposed which takes away from some of the sharpness you could have had.  not a terrible photo by any means but not a contender either.  5', '2003-05-16 11:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(300079, 21348, 8709, '<td valign="top">this is a great "orange" picture! 9</td>', 'this is a great "orange" picture! 9', '2003-05-16 11:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(300080, 21350, 675, '<td valign="top">ok two things. first the orange thing, whatever it is, should be more visible. second the shutter speed was not fast enough to totally freeze the splash, making the splash look blurry some things that are good are that you met the challenge and i also like the crop you used, creating a lot of negative space. 5</td>', 'ok two things. first the orange thing, whatever it is, should be more visible. second the shutter speed was not fast enough to totally freeze the splash, making the splash look blurry some things that are good are that you met the challenge and i also like the crop you used, creating a lot of negative space. 5', '2003-05-16 11:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
