(300082, 21191, 675, '<td valign="top">nice wow factor on this one for me. you really got the focus just right. was there a reason that you cut off the rest of the pistols or stamens or whatever they are?  colors are nice here, and the photo is pleasing to the eye. 6</td>', 'nice wow factor on this one for me. you really got the focus just right. was there a reason that you cut off the rest of the pistols or stamens or whatever they are?  colors are nice here, and the photo is pleasing to the eye. 6', '2003-05-16 11:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
