(300092, 21423, 2764, '<td valign="top">straighten your horizon - don''t cut off his shoes - maybe increase the contrast - lots of emotion here - but not much "technique" - I like the locked door - then of course there is that issue of color....6</td>', 'straighten your horizon - don''t cut off his shoes - maybe increase the contrast - lots of emotion here - but not much "technique" - I like the locked door - then of course there is that issue of color....6', '2003-05-16 11:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(300093, 21490, 675, '<td valign="top">this is a superb capture. the reflections off the water are great, the colors are great. your composition is great. nice wow factor for me. 8</td>', 'this is a superb capture. the reflections off the water are great, the colors are great. your composition is great. nice wow factor for me. 8', '2003-05-16 11:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(300098, 21087, 675, '<td valign="top">this is a really neat flower. very unique. there is one problem with this photo. everesposure. underexposing this photo might have helped you regain more sharpness that was lost when you took the photo. the photo composition is nice, the overexposure just seems to bleed all of the elements into indistinguishable parts to some extent. 6</td>', 'this is a really neat flower. very unique. there is one problem with this photo. everesposure. underexposing this photo might have helped you regain more sharpness that was lost when you took the photo. the photo composition is nice, the overexposure just seems to bleed all of the elements into indistinguishable parts to some extent. 6', '2003-05-16 11:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(300101, 20852, 8709, '<td valign="top">the only "secondary" color i see here is green, sorry...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-21 07:40:49.</i></td>', 'the only "secondary" color i see here is green, sorry...', '2003-05-16 11:43:00.000000', '2003-05-21 08:40:49.000000', 1),
(300102, 21122, 675, '<td valign="top">things i would do differently on this shot. 1. don''t use a flash next time, flashed really kill the look of flowers by washing out the colors.  2. get rid of those paper clips. 4</td>', 'things i would do differently on this shot. 1. don''t use a flash next time, flashed really kill the look of flowers by washing out the colors.  2. get rid of those paper clips. 4', '2003-05-16 11:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
