(300110, 21003, 8709, '<td valign="top">i see a lot of jpeg artifacts here, probably because of post processing... if you save your original as an uncompressed tiff, do all of the manipulations with it, and then save the final version as a jpeg, it should help the problem... as it looks now, i can only give it a 2, sorry...</td>', 'i see a lot of jpeg artifacts here, probably because of post processing... if you save your original as an uncompressed tiff, do all of the manipulations with it, and then save the final version as a jpeg, it should help the problem... as it looks now, i can only give it a 2, sorry...', '2003-05-16 11:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
