(300147, 21244, 5112, '<td valign="top">Where''d you find that?!?!  Didn''t your mom tell you to eat your lemons before they turn fuzzy?  Gret detail here.</td>', 'Where''d you find that?!?!  Didn''t your mom tell you to eat your lemons before they turn fuzzy?  Gret detail here.', '2003-05-16 12:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(300149, 21003, 5112, '<td valign="top">The colours are beautiful, but the picture is out of focus and there''s a fair bit of noise, especially at the horizon and the waterlines.  I think you took this in low light without a tripod?  Something to steady the camera might have helped.  Great colours though.</td>', 'The colours are beautiful, but the picture is out of focus and there''s a fair bit of noise, especially at the horizon and the waterlines.  I think you took this in low light without a tripod?  Something to steady the camera might have helped.  Great colours though.', '2003-05-16 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
