(300194, 21134, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a striking mix of colours - I love the way in which each colour appears in such random segments. I think the shapes are secondary to the colour here. This works well as an abstract. Because of the way that the shapes are overwhelmed by the colour I think composition is quite hard to appreciate.</td>', 'Wow! What a striking mix of colours - I love the way in which each colour appears in such random segments. I think the shapes are secondary to the colour here. This works well as an abstract. Because of the way that the shapes are overwhelmed by the colour I think composition is quite hard to appreciate.', '2003-05-16 13:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(300195, 21326, 4517, '<td valign="top">Sticks right out of the screen. There are a few things that could be changed like the background and border. A thiner border would look nicer and a different colour. Focus could be better on center of flower and composition is to centered. Sorry for picking so many holes in your photo, just trying to help. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Sticks right out of the screen. There are a few things that could be changed like the background and border. A thiner border would look nicer and a different colour. Focus could be better on center of flower and composition is to centered. Sorry for picking so many holes in your photo, just trying to help. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-16 13:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
