(300429, 21353, 5120, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, however I dont find highlighters all that exciting.  Clever picture though.  I like the composition and technically the photo looks very well done.  I just wish there were more going on here to hold my attention.  I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This is an interesting idea, however I dont find highlighters all that exciting.  Clever picture though.  I like the composition and technically the photo looks very well done.  I just wish there were more going on here to hold my attention.  I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-05-16 16:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(300430, 21445, 5391, '<td valign="top">Well, this would win the title contest if we had one.  :)  Beautiful color in the image, I wish it were bigger so I could see more detail, though.</td>', 'Well, this would win the title contest if we had one.  :)  Beautiful color in the image, I wish it were bigger so I could see more detail, though.', '2003-05-16 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
