(300434, 21387, 5120, '<td valign="top">I like the camera angle and the idea for this picture but something isnt quite right.  It just doesnt look natural, maybe it is the white balance?  I also dont like the way the light is reflecting off the label of the middle bottle.  I know the lighting is very harsh in those refrigs and that aspect of this picture is more accurate but I find the bright speculars to be distracting.  I think the shot was well composed though. I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I like the camera angle and the idea for this picture but something isnt quite right.  It just doesnt look natural, maybe it is the white balance?  I also dont like the way the light is reflecting off the label of the middle bottle.  I know the lighting is very harsh in those refrigs and that aspect of this picture is more accurate but I find the bright speculars to be distracting.  I think the shot was well composed though. I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-05-16 16:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
