(300532, 21393, 4411, '<td valign="top">It''s not often I like such an obviously processed shot in the challenges but this one does it for me. Love the colours and the texture on the orange background - almost looks like flames. Great stuff, well done.</td>', 'It''s not often I like such an obviously processed shot in the challenges but this one does it for me. Love the colours and the texture on the orange background - almost looks like flames. Great stuff, well done.', '2003-05-16 18:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
