(300550, 21441, 4411, '<td valign="top">My eyes are wandering around this trying to settle on a *really* sharp drop, but not quite finding it.<br/>It''s a shame the big drop with the leaf refracted in in isn''t snapping out at me, but otherwise I like this. The overall feel is and the colour are great.<br/>Maybe a touch more contrast, darkening it a little, would help?</td>', 'My eyes are wandering around this trying to settle on a *really* sharp drop, but not quite finding it.It''s a shame the big drop with the leaf refracted in in isn''t snapping out at me, but otherwise I like this. The overall feel is and the colour are great.Maybe a touch more contrast, darkening it a little, would help?', '2003-05-16 18:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
