(300559, 21278, 4411, '<td valign="top">The composition is great, jumps right out at you straight away.<br/>After looking for a bit longer though the image appears *too* soft, like is been run through neatimage.<br/>Colours are lovely and the image is pleasing, well done.</td>', 'The composition is great, jumps right out at you straight away.After looking for a bit longer though the image appears *too* soft, like is been run through neatimage.Colours are lovely and the image is pleasing, well done.', '2003-05-16 19:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
