(300588, 21093, 6999, '<td valign="top">Kind of nice idea, but there area  couple of things that are killing it for me. Firstly, the flash lighting - really flattens things out, and leaves that very brutal shadow. Secondly the placing of the parts of the shot - and especially the lower surface: if you''d shot from a little lower you wouldn''t have had the table in shot and there would have been more of just the colours.</td>', 'Kind of nice idea, but there area  couple of things that are killing it for me. Firstly, the flash lighting - really flattens things out, and leaves that very brutal shadow. Secondly the placing of the parts of the shot - and especially the lower surface: if you''d shot from a little lower you wouldn''t have had the table in shot and there would have been more of just the colours.', '2003-05-16 21:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(300590, 21094, 6999, '<td valign="top">I hope you understand when i say that this seems to be more about the path than the greens - or perhaps the tree trunk. It''s a lovely photo, especially the texture of that three trunk - but the interest for me is all in the non-green stuff. Had it been me, I''d perhaps have under-exposed a stop or so, just to saturate the colours more - but then the muted contrasts here are such a strong part of the image.</td>', 'I hope you understand when i say that this seems to be more about the path than the greens - or perhaps the tree trunk. It''s a lovely photo, especially the texture of that three trunk - but the interest for me is all in the non-green stuff. Had it been me, I''d perhaps have under-exposed a stop or so, just to saturate the colours more - but then the muted contrasts here are such a strong part of the image.', '2003-05-16 21:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(300591, 21408, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement</td>', 'I like the arrangement', '2003-05-16 21:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(300593, 21372, 6999, '<td valign="top">Veyr grainy - perhaps over-compressed as it''s a very small file size. The lighting also seems very flat to me, which kills a lot of the interest. It''s also a little ... disorganised looking: I think because the lines of the fingers, and arms, and the alignment of the paint box are too random-looking.</td>', 'Veyr grainy - perhaps over-compressed as it''s a very small file size. The lighting also seems very flat to me, which kills a lot of the interest. It''s also a little ... disorganised looking: I think because the lines of the fingers, and arms, and the alignment of the paint box are too random-looking.', '2003-05-16 21:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
