(300626, 21457, 3981, '<td valign="top">One of the most appealing flower photographs I have ever seen.  It should place very well in the competition. I love the focus, the lighting and even the 3 color border.</td>', 'One of the most appealing flower photographs I have ever seen.  It should place very well in the competition. I love the focus, the lighting and even the 3 color border.', '2003-05-16 22:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
