(300634, 21293, 3981, '<td valign="top">What a lovely, appealing picture.  The couple on the beach adds so much interest. Your composition here is near perfect.  Nice one.</td>', 'What a lovely, appealing picture.  The couple on the beach adds so much interest. Your composition here is near perfect.  Nice one.', '2003-05-16 22:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
