(300636, 21436, 3981, '<td valign="top">Lighting and background are excellent.  For my taste, I would have liked to have seen a little sharper focus and a "not-so-set-squarely-in-the-middle" composition.  Nevertheless, it is a very appealing photo.  Good job.</td>', 'Lighting and background are excellent.  For my taste, I would have liked to have seen a little sharper focus and a "not-so-set-squarely-in-the-middle" composition.  Nevertheless, it is a very appealing photo.  Good job.', '2003-05-16 22:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(300637, 21408, 3981, '<td valign="top">The focus here is so terrific, I could almost pick up one of the beans or carrots!  The only detraction for me is the glass "whatever-that-is" on the right side.  I love the lighting, too.</td>', 'The focus here is so terrific, I could almost pick up one of the beans or carrots!  The only detraction for me is the glass "whatever-that-is" on the right side.  I love the lighting, too.', '2003-05-16 22:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(300638, 21351, 3981, '<td valign="top">An awesome photo.  Colors and lighting are near perfect.  For my own personal taste, I would have liked a little sharper focus.  Still, it is a very beautiful picture.</td>', 'An awesome photo.  Colors and lighting are near perfect.  For my own personal taste, I would have liked a little sharper focus.  Still, it is a very beautiful picture.', '2003-05-16 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
