(300655, 21299, 6325, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting effect.  I really like the use of shape. I would like to see how it looks with lower exposure - I would expect the water to go dark and frame the lilly pads which would be a deeper green and the flowers would have definition.</td>', 'This is an interesting effect.  I really like the use of shape. I would like to see how it looks with lower exposure - I would expect the water to go dark and frame the lilly pads which would be a deeper green and the flowers would have definition.', '2003-05-16 23:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
