(300667, 21450, 1519, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Love the colors of the flowers together and against the black background.  Love the waterdrops.  Nice composition and frame. Not sure about the one green stem, though. 9</td>', 'Very pretty.  Love the colors of the flowers together and against the black background.  Love the waterdrops.  Nice composition and frame. Not sure about the one green stem, though. 9', '2003-05-16 23:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
