(300835, 20972, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and the ''fiery'' colour is superb, but this lacks enough sharpness to bring out the detail. The dark areas could probably do to be a bit darker too, as it is it seems a bit noisy in the shadows.<br/>Good composition, and I would like to know how you achieved the effect with the colour.</td>', 'Great idea, and the ''fiery'' colour is superb, but this lacks enough sharpness to bring out the detail. The dark areas could probably do to be a bit darker too, as it is it seems a bit noisy in the shadows.Good composition, and I would like to know how you achieved the effect with the colour.', '2003-05-17 10:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(300838, 21333, 4411, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject, but a somewhat plain shot. Shooting this from several different angles, from low down, from the side, closer in, etc would likely have provided a more eye grabbing shot than the straight-on, centered composition. Personally I would have made a bee-line for the lock and switched to macro mode.<br/>Technically well done, but doesn''t really grab the attention of the viewer.</td>', 'An interesting subject, but a somewhat plain shot. Shooting this from several different angles, from low down, from the side, closer in, etc would likely have provided a more eye grabbing shot than the straight-on, centered composition. Personally I would have made a bee-line for the lock and switched to macro mode.Technically well done, but doesn''t really grab the attention of the viewer.', '2003-05-17 10:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(300839, 21350, 4411, '<td valign="top">Now that''s taking the splash photo to a whole new level!<br/>Great idea, and the splash is well captured, but the composition lets it down. The top half of the photo, after the first wave, is wasted in this shot because the focal point is right down at the bottom.</td>', 'Now that''s taking the splash photo to a whole new level!Great idea, and the splash is well captured, but the composition lets it down. The top half of the photo, after the first wave, is wasted in this shot because the focal point is right down at the bottom.', '2003-05-17 10:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(300840, 21334, 4411, '<td valign="top">A super shot of the ''ball'' of flowers, focus &amp; DoF here are spot on, but the overall composition lets it down. The petal at the front is probably the most distracting, and the stamen from the ball are starting to creep out of frame. Good effort, and lovely flowers.</td>', 'A super shot of the ''ball'' of flowers, focus & DoF here are spot on, but the overall composition lets it down. The petal at the front is probably the most distracting, and the stamen from the ball are starting to creep out of frame. Good effort, and lovely flowers.', '2003-05-17 10:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(300857, 21426, 6870, '<td valign="top">wonderful use of lines.</td>', 'wonderful use of lines.', '2003-05-17 11:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(300859, 20945, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lighting really brings this macro''s lines into their own.</td>', 'Lighting really brings this macro''s lines into their own.', '2003-05-17 11:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(300860, 21314, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the blur on this,making it an abstract.</td>', 'I love the blur on this,making it an abstract.', '2003-05-17 11:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(300861, 21445, 6870, '<td valign="top">The title makes my mind bend in weird directions, and the photo is lovely, though very small. There are several forum threads on how to make you image larger.</td>', 'The title makes my mind bend in weird directions, and the photo is lovely, though very small. There are several forum threads on how to make you image larger.', '2003-05-17 11:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
