(300902, 21252, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice colors but this shot has potential to be better. First, the lighting coming from the top creates shadows on the bottom that detract from the softness that I think you''re trying to portray here. Secondly, I find the focus a bit too soft and also, would have liked a crop that rendered the subject in the middle of the frame.</td>', 'Nice colors but this shot has potential to be better. First, the lighting coming from the top creates shadows on the bottom that detract from the softness that I think you''re trying to portray here. Secondly, I find the focus a bit too soft and also, would have liked a crop that rendered the subject in the middle of the frame.', '2003-05-17 12:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
