(301086, 21498, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here very much and the juxtaposition (oh dear, that''s the second time in as many days that I''ve used that word!!) of the textures of the orange skin and the plate. Lighting on the near side of the orange is a touch dark for my preference.</td>', 'I like the composition here very much and the juxtaposition (oh dear, that''s the second time in as many days that I''ve used that word!!) of the textures of the orange skin and the plate. Lighting on the near side of the orange is a touch dark for my preference.', '2003-05-17 20:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(301087, 21251, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely image and I like the DOF and composition and the variation of colour in the background. The way the water droplets catch the light is very appealing. I''d like just a touch more light in the lower left area of the flower.</td>', 'A lovely image and I like the DOF and composition and the variation of colour in the background. The way the water droplets catch the light is very appealing. I''d like just a touch more light in the lower left area of the flower.', '2003-05-17 20:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(301088, 21424, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the darkness in this shot - somewhat sinisiter. The colours and the way they are refracted by the glass is wonderful - would have been good in that challenge to. I would like a touch more space above and maybe a little below the pieces, not a huge amount though. Very nice.</td>', 'I love the darkness in this shot - somewhat sinisiter. The colours and the way they are refracted by the glass is wonderful - would have been good in that challenge to. I would like a touch more space above and maybe a little below the pieces, not a huge amount though. Very nice.', '2003-05-17 20:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(301089, 21320, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful - really simply and I love the way the water splits the colours in the background. The two main droplets add further to the strong composition. I also like the graininess in the green, but less so in the orange. Am curious to learn whether it was a deliberate choice (ISO etc) or an artifact of compression.</td>', 'Wonderful - really simply and I love the way the water splits the colours in the background. The two main droplets add further to the strong composition. I also like the graininess in the green, but less so in the orange. Am curious to learn whether it was a deliberate choice (ISO etc) or an artifact of compression.', '2003-05-17 20:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(301091, 21317, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love this abstract - a cross between a painting and a photo - perhaps leans towards the painting even more than the photo! Great DOF - love the way it reduces the flowers and grass to mere blurs of colour. Only thing I''d change would be to deadhead that flower at the very bottom left!!! ;)</td>', 'I love this abstract - a cross between a painting and a photo - perhaps leans towards the painting even more than the photo! Great DOF - love the way it reduces the flowers and grass to mere blurs of colour. Only thing I''d change would be to deadhead that flower at the very bottom left!!! ;)', '2003-05-17 20:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(301092, 21358, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is really nice, what a lucky find! 8</td>', 'this is really nice, what a lucky find! 8', '2003-05-17 20:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(301094, 21469, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a striking image - the composition is great - not just your own but the spacing of the buds that happen to have burst open to orange. Your viewpoint is well chosen.<br/>Changes in colour in out of focus backgrounds don''t always bother me but the white area at the lower left does. The background also seems rather grainy - perhaps the whole image is but this is less easily noticable in the central area.</td>', 'Wow! What a striking image - the composition is great - not just your own but the spacing of the buds that happen to have burst open to orange. Your viewpoint is well chosen.Changes in colour in out of focus backgrounds don''t always bother me but the white area at the lower left does. The background also seems rather grainy - perhaps the whole image is but this is less easily noticable in the central area.', '2003-05-17 20:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
