(301271, 21122, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Nice soft color on the oragne.  Did you use a flash on the flowers?  I kind of makes it look flat (not shadows).  Still a very nice shot.  Jacko.</td>', 'Wow.  Nice soft color on the oragne.  Did you use a flash on the flowers?  I kind of makes it look flat (not shadows).  Still a very nice shot.  Jacko.', '2003-05-18 08:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
