(301273, 21394, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good eye for spotting colors, however the main subject really appears to be the clock.  I''d like this picuture to say color first, then give it context with the clock. Good  luck.  Jacko.</td>', 'Good eye for spotting colors, however the main subject really appears to be the clock.  I''d like this picuture to say color first, then give it context with the clock. Good  luck.  Jacko.', '2003-05-18 08:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(301274, 21087, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle and composition.  Remove the other flower on the left with PS and this would make a really nice print.  the flower''s petals are a bit blown out but I know it must be hard to properly expose such a light color against a dark background.  Good work. Jacko.  8</td>', 'Excellent angle and composition.  Remove the other flower on the left with PS and this would make a really nice print.  the flower''s petals are a bit blown out but I know it must be hard to properly expose such a light color against a dark background.  Good work. Jacko.  8', '2003-05-18 08:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(301275, 21439, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the compositoin, the model is cute, but the purple under the eyes  makes her look ill.   Sorry just my thoughts.  Still a very effective shot.  Jscko.  8</td>', 'I like the compositoin, the model is cute, but the purple under the eyes  makes her look ill.   Sorry just my thoughts.  Still a very effective shot.  Jscko.  8', '2003-05-18 08:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
