(301637, 21409, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very very cool.  Great creativity.  Love how they mix at two places.  At the intersection and in the glass.  Very cool.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Very very cool.  Great creativity.  Love how they mix at two places.  At the intersection and in the glass.  Very cool.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9', '2003-05-18 23:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
