(301642, 21450, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very effective composition.  the simple border is a nice touch too.  The colors really stand out.  the rain drops might be a bit much, but still a wonderfull image.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Very effective composition.  the simple border is a nice touch too.  The colors really stand out.  the rain drops might be a bit much, but still a wonderfull image.  Jacko.  8', '2003-05-18 23:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
