(301656, 21305, 2716, '<td valign="top">yucky!  cough syrup.  Very effective shot.  I don''t konw why but I like it.  I think it''s the soft tones.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'yucky!  cough syrup.  Very effective shot.  I don''t konw why but I like it.  I think it''s the soft tones.  Jacko.  8', '2003-05-18 23:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(301658, 21492, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great perspective,  finally a creative shot with tulips.  your angle make the tulips looks like they''re leaping at me.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Great perspective,  finally a creative shot with tulips.  your angle make the tulips looks like they''re leaping at me.  Jacko.  10', '2003-05-18 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(301659, 21347, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull shot.  I''d like to see a bigger picture to see more detail.  Great capture.  jacko.</td>', 'Wonderfull shot.  I''d like to see a bigger picture to see more detail.  Great capture.  jacko.', '2003-05-18 23:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(301676, 21413, 7033, '<td valign="top">Color of the flowers is very nice, however, in my opinion, the shot has been oversharpened to the point of being excessive, especially the ''halos'' around the edges of the flowers themselves.</td>', 'Color of the flowers is very nice, however, in my opinion, the shot has been oversharpened to the point of being excessive, especially the ''halos'' around the edges of the flowers themselves.', '2003-05-18 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(301678, 21441, 7033, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF and imperfect water droplets add a lot of interest, in my opinion.  I find the border a bit heavy for the shot, though.</td>', 'Shallow DOF and imperfect water droplets add a lot of interest, in my opinion.  I find the border a bit heavy for the shot, though.', '2003-05-18 23:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(301685, 21313, 7033, '<td valign="top">I like the color you have captured in the flower.  However, in my opinion, the composition just doesn''t quite seem ''right''... it''s a bit off balance:  not quite centered, not quite rule-of-thirds.  I would suggest bringing the yellow center of the flower a bit more left in the frame (closer to thirds), and using the nice line formed by the contrast of the green and brown to lead the viewer''s eyes to the rest of the image.  A shallower depth-of-field focused on the center of the flower might also serve to reduce the impact of the more distracting background.</td>', 'I like the color you have captured in the flower.  However, in my opinion, the composition just doesn''t quite seem ''right''... it''s a bit off balance:  not quite centered, not quite rule-of-thirds.  I would suggest bringing the yellow center of the flower a bit more left in the frame (closer to thirds), and using the nice line formed by the contrast of the green and brown to lead the viewer''s eyes to the rest of the image.  A shallower depth-of-field focused on the center of the flower might also serve to reduce the impact of the more distracting background.', '2003-05-18 23:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(301687, 21470, 7033, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the deeply saturated purple of the flower itself!  Shallow DOF really fits well here, and the border accentuates the shot nicely.  In my opinion, the center of the flower is a bit overexposed, and there seems to be some odd noise along the top edge of the petals that I find somewhat distracting.  --6</td>', 'I LOVE the deeply saturated purple of the flower itself!  Shallow DOF really fits well here, and the border accentuates the shot nicely.  In my opinion, the center of the flower is a bit overexposed, and there seems to be some odd noise along the top edge of the petals that I find somewhat distracting.  --6', '2003-05-18 23:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(301692, 21475, 772, '<td valign="top">intersting use of desaturation... subjectively, the photo doesn''t really provide me with anyting truly interesting to look at... I think that depending on a ''trick'' such as desaturation to support a photo is not always the best idea.  Desaturation like this can definitely help highlight your subject, but you probably need a more interesting subject for it to create a lot of impact... = 5</td>', 'intersting use of desaturation... subjectively, the photo doesn''t really provide me with anyting truly interesting to look at... I think that depending on a ''trick'' such as desaturation to support a photo is not always the best idea.  Desaturation like this can definitely help highlight your subject, but you probably need a more interesting subject for it to create a lot of impact... = 5', '2003-05-19 00:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(301720, 21321, 7706, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean. Great work. I wish I could get glass to look that good lol</td>', 'Simple and clean. Great work. I wish I could get glass to look that good lol', '2003-05-19 00:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(301721, 21305, 7706, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite photos from this challene. I love your saturation work with the colors. However there is a little bit of reflection under the spoon, is there anywway of minimizing that?</td>', 'This is one of my favorite photos from this challene. I love your saturation work with the colors. However there is a little bit of reflection under the spoon, is there anywway of minimizing that?', '2003-05-19 00:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(301745, 21260, 811, '<td valign="top">Did you try using a polarizer (if possible) to eliminate that glare?  Of course, the one spot of purple is interesting.</td>', 'Did you try using a polarizer (if possible) to eliminate that glare?  Of course, the one spot of purple is interesting.', '2003-05-19 00:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(301746, 21449, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but it seems a bit overexposed, which is causing some of the details in the trees to disappera.</td>', 'Nice color, but it seems a bit overexposed, which is causing some of the details in the trees to disappera.', '2003-05-19 00:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(301747, 21305, 811, '<td valign="top">Simple, but very well done.</td>', 'Simple, but very well done.', '2003-05-19 00:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(301828, 21417, 6172, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space at the top</td>', 'Too much empty space at the top', '2003-05-19 03:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(301832, 21313, 6172, '<td valign="top">I would say that is blue, but you meet the challenge because that is definitely green in the photo.</td>', 'I would say that is blue, but you meet the challenge because that is definitely green in the photo.', '2003-05-19 03:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
