(302189, 21235, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the pattern of the plants and how the straight rows "demand" attention and then lead the eyes up through the field.</td>', 'I really like the pattern of the plants and how the straight rows "demand" attention and then lead the eyes up through the field.', '2003-05-19 15:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(302192, 21310, 811, '<td valign="top">A sharp focus that would have shown the texture of the board better would have made it look more like the gears were moving, instead of being out of focus, I think.  Cool idea.</td>', 'A sharp focus that would have shown the texture of the board better would have made it look more like the gears were moving, instead of being out of focus, I think.  Cool idea.', '2003-05-19 15:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
