(302200, 21003, 811, '<td valign="top">A sharper focus would have made this shot outstanding.  As it is the colors are nice, but the edges fo the bridge and trees detract from that.</td>', 'A sharper focus would have made this shot outstanding.  As it is the colors are nice, but the edges fo the bridge and trees detract from that.', '2003-05-19 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(302201, 21491, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  Maybe a bit too much space in the lower left, but it is still a nice picture.</td>', 'Great focus.  Maybe a bit too much space in the lower left, but it is still a nice picture.', '2003-05-19 15:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(302203, 20951, 811, '<td valign="top">The color seems a little muted to me.  Would it have been possible to saturate it just a touch?  The depth of field is very nice.</td>', 'The color seems a little muted to me.  Would it have been possible to saturate it just a touch?  The depth of field is very nice.', '2003-05-19 15:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(302208, 20945, 811, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  Would have been cool if an orange and purple caterpillar had been munching his way across. :-)</td>', 'Great detail.  Would have been cool if an orange and purple caterpillar had been munching his way across. :-)', '2003-05-19 15:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(302211, 21471, 811, '<td valign="top">having tried a shot with bubble before, you have my respect for actually getting them in focus.  The only thing that would have really made this shot for me would be a background of a different color.  At least I think so.  The colors may not have shown up as well that way.  Anyway, awesome job!  10</td>', 'having tried a shot with bubble before, you have my respect for actually getting them in focus.  The only thing that would have really made this shot for me would be a background of a different color.  At least I think so.  The colors may not have shown up as well that way.  Anyway, awesome job!  10', '2003-05-19 15:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(302213, 21353, 811, '<td valign="top">The white balance seems to be a little off, I think.  The paper looks blue instead of white to me.  Great idea though!</td>', 'The white balance seems to be a little off, I think.  The paper looks blue instead of white to me.  Great idea though!', '2003-05-19 15:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(302216, 20976, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I think the vertical "motion" of the boats is a nice touch, though I guess it could appear very busy.  Also, the orange in the sky and the green in the water sets up a nice contrast!</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I think the vertical "motion" of the boats is a nice touch, though I guess it could appear very busy.  Also, the orange in the sky and the green in the water sets up a nice contrast!', '2003-05-19 15:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(302225, 21307, 811, '<td valign="top">That is too funny.  I was scrolling down looking for a candy bar!!!  Great shot.</td>', 'That is too funny.  I was scrolling down looking for a candy bar!!!  Great shot.', '2003-05-19 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(302242, 20882, 8613, '<td valign="top">Great clarity! Interesting subject!</td>', 'Great clarity! Interesting subject!', '2003-05-19 16:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(302243, 21473, 8613, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2003-05-19 16:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(302292, 21394, 8488, '<td valign="top">Hrm. A good choice of subject, but the lighting''s kind of diminished. Maybe a little gamma-correction in the computer (or a desk/floor lamp directed up at it while being shot) would have made it more emphatic.<br/> <br/>Also, the pixelation really isn''t helping.</td>', 'Hrm. A good choice of subject, but the lighting''s kind of diminished. Maybe a little gamma-correction in the computer (or a desk/floor lamp directed up at it while being shot) would have made it more emphatic. Also, the pixelation really isn''t helping.', '2003-05-19 17:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(302294, 21416, 8488, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting, nicely composed.</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting, nicely composed.', '2003-05-19 17:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(302295, 21260, 8488, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, with the day-glo fish hanging in the center. It''s clearly an outdoor shot, so you likely couldn''t do much about the lighting, but a side-light source off to the left would haev improved the focus on the fish, I think.</td>', 'I love this shot, with the day-glo fish hanging in the center. It''s clearly an outdoor shot, so you likely couldn''t do much about the lighting, but a side-light source off to the left would haev improved the focus on the fish, I think.', '2003-05-19 17:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(302296, 21492, 8488, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, great focus, and the colors are crisp and bright.</td>', 'Lovely composition, great focus, and the colors are crisp and bright.', '2003-05-19 17:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(302297, 21248, 8488, '<td valign="top">Graet personality on the subject, nicely composed, great focus and lighting.</td>', 'Graet personality on the subject, nicely composed, great focus and lighting.', '2003-05-19 17:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(302298, 21140, 8488, '<td valign="top">Great concept and composition, but the focus almost looks mushy in spots. I''m not exactly sure why. Maybe your camera focussed on the tiles instead of the chair? Still, quite nice.</td>', 'Great concept and composition, but the focus almost looks mushy in spots. I''m not exactly sure why. Maybe your camera focussed on the tiles instead of the chair? Still, quite nice.', '2003-05-19 17:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(302299, 21076, 8488, '<td valign="top">Great concept and decent lighting, but pixelation in the juice robs your image of the sharpness it might otherwise have had.</td>', 'Great concept and decent lighting, but pixelation in the juice robs your image of the sharpness it might otherwise have had.', '2003-05-19 17:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(302302, 20938, 8488, '<td valign="top">The pixelation and bizarre stretch to the proportions bother me, and distract from what otherwise might be a very nice picture, making the girl look deformed.</td>', 'The pixelation and bizarre stretch to the proportions bother me, and distract from what otherwise might be a very nice picture, making the girl look deformed.', '2003-05-19 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(302303, 20954, 8488, '<td valign="top">Love the sharp focus on the flower, soft focus on the ferns in the background. Luminous color.</td>', 'Love the sharp focus on the flower, soft focus on the ferns in the background. Luminous color.', '2003-05-19 17:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(302304, 21324, 8488, '<td valign="top">A beautiful piece, beautifully lit (and reflecting!)</td>', 'A beautiful piece, beautifully lit (and reflecting!)', '2003-05-19 17:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(302305, 21119, 8488, '<td valign="top">If this were (a) bigger, (b) more detailed, and (c) better focused, it might well have gotten a 10 from me. Of course, I''m a sucker for pretty clouds with good sharp tree-silhouettes in front of them, so I''m biased. :-&gt;</td>', 'If this were (a) bigger, (b) more detailed, and (c) better focused, it might well have gotten a 10 from me. Of course, I''m a sucker for pretty clouds with good sharp tree-silhouettes in front of them, so I''m biased. :->', '2003-05-19 17:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(302306, 21377, 8488, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot; the focus is a little softer than I''d prefer, though, and the splash of light in the foreground distracts from the general shapes and lights above. 8, but could have been 10.</td>', 'Lovely shot; the focus is a little softer than I''d prefer, though, and the splash of light in the foreground distracts from the general shapes and lights above. 8, but could have been 10.', '2003-05-19 17:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(302307, 21450, 8488, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus, good colors, good composition.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus, good colors, good composition.', '2003-05-19 17:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(302308, 21400, 8488, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s ''derivative'' of earlier images, but it''s still a lovely execution of the ''looking through water drops'' trope, and it includes a legitimate secondary color, so I''m grading it highly. :-&gt; If the things refracted in the droplets were more appealing/interestingly composed, it might have gotten a 10 from me, in fact, given the technical skill displayed, but they aren''t, so 8.</td>', 'Yes, it''s ''derivative'' of earlier images, but it''s still a lovely execution of the ''looking through water drops'' trope, and it includes a legitimate secondary color, so I''m grading it highly. :-> If the things refracted in the droplets were more appealing/interestingly composed, it might have gotten a 10 from me, in fact, given the technical skill displayed, but they aren''t, so 8.', '2003-05-19 17:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(302309, 21283, 8488, '<td valign="top">This has almost a snapshot feel, probably a combination of the lighting and the focus (which is either odd, or sharpened strangely in postproduction). The composition''s also a little mushy - the eye isn''t drawn to any one particular place, and so it wanders around to no purpose, as it were. Still, fits the theme well (nice colors).</td>', 'This has almost a snapshot feel, probably a combination of the lighting and the focus (which is either odd, or sharpened strangely in postproduction). The composition''s also a little mushy - the eye isn''t drawn to any one particular place, and so it wanders around to no purpose, as it were. Still, fits the theme well (nice colors).', '2003-05-19 17:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(302311, 21158, 8488, '<td valign="top">A great bright green picture of leaves, but there''s nothing really in the image to be interesting, no center of the composition or subject for it to be ''about''.</td>', 'A great bright green picture of leaves, but there''s nothing really in the image to be interesting, no center of the composition or subject for it to be ''about''.', '2003-05-19 17:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(302312, 21137, 8488, '<td valign="top">A nice green picture, and so it first the topic of the challenge, but the composition is squarely ''snapshot.'' A different crop, probably centering (interest-wise, not necessarily geometrically) on the right-hand horse, might have gotten a 9 or 10 from me.</td>', 'A nice green picture, and so it first the topic of the challenge, but the composition is squarely ''snapshot.'' A different crop, probably centering (interest-wise, not necessarily geometrically) on the right-hand horse, might have gotten a 9 or 10 from me.', '2003-05-19 17:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
