(302398, 21305, 8377, '<td valign="top">Looking on the spoon, the liquid looks almost black, and I know its probably from the quantity of the liquid there and also the dark spoon.  So this is why I really like the purple liquid surrounding the spoon.  The liquid on the surface really adds a bunch to the picture.  Very good composition.</td>', 'Looking on the spoon, the liquid looks almost black, and I know its probably from the quantity of the liquid there and also the dark spoon.  So this is why I really like the purple liquid surrounding the spoon.  The liquid on the surface really adds a bunch to the picture.  Very good composition.', '2003-05-19 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(302400, 21168, 8377, '<td valign="top">Very creative photograph.  I like the elements of this one.  I kind of wish I could see a bit of the stem of the bottle though.  And I find the large grey border to be a bit distracting.  Excellent job though, because you made me want a snack of cheese, pickles, and bread!</td>', 'Very creative photograph.  I like the elements of this one.  I kind of wish I could see a bit of the stem of the bottle though.  And I find the large grey border to be a bit distracting.  Excellent job though, because you made me want a snack of cheese, pickles, and bread!', '2003-05-19 19:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(302401, 21094, 8377, '<td valign="top">I very much like the feel of the photograph.  I want to step into the photo and walk along the path and go exploring, see where it takes me.  Great job and great color.</td>', 'I very much like the feel of the photograph.  I want to step into the photo and walk along the path and go exploring, see where it takes me.  Great job and great color.', '2003-05-19 19:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
