(302565, 21409, 8637, '<td valign="top">Too cool!  Excellent idea and beautifully done. Might have been better to have full illumination across the backdrop?  thanks</td>', 'Too cool!  Excellent idea and beautifully done. Might have been better to have full illumination across the backdrop?  thanks', '2003-05-19 20:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(302566, 21305, 8637, '<td valign="top">Neat idea...well done.  thanks</td>', 'Neat idea...well done.  thanks', '2003-05-19 20:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(302572, 21424, 8377, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  Are those just orange, purple and green lights shone on there or is it something else?  I love how the green, purple, and orange show up through the chess pieces.  Clear and intriguing photo.</td>', 'I love this photo!  Are those just orange, purple and green lights shone on there or is it something else?  I love how the green, purple, and orange show up through the chess pieces.  Clear and intriguing photo.', '2003-05-19 20:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(302574, 21492, 8377, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph.  I love how the shadows on this are pretty soft.  I like the angle this photo was taken at also, and the photo seems so clear.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph.  I love how the shadows on this are pretty soft.  I like the angle this photo was taken at also, and the photo seems so clear.', '2003-05-19 20:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(302575, 21334, 8377, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition.  Very clear also.  Beautiful photograph.</td>', 'Wonderful composition.  Very clear also.  Beautiful photograph.', '2003-05-19 20:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(302576, 21480, 8377, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenge.  The blobiness of the paint is nice.  Something about how the purple paint looks just draws me in.  Great job</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenge.  The blobiness of the paint is nice.  Something about how the purple paint looks just draws me in.  Great job', '2003-05-19 20:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(302578, 21303, 8377, '<td valign="top">The grass just looks so green and crisp.  It really makes the orange "pop."  Nice, clear photograph.</td>', 'The grass just looks so green and crisp.  It really makes the orange "pop."  Nice, clear photograph.', '2003-05-19 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(302581, 21305, 8130, '<td valign="top">Hope it''s not the "Mad Purple Cow Disease"!  Love the composition, the color and absence of color and the spills.</td>', 'Hope it''s not the "Mad Purple Cow Disease"!  Love the composition, the color and absence of color and the spills.', '2003-05-19 21:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(302587, 21410, 8130, '<td valign="top">Love the balance, color and crop.  Jewel-like colors don''t hurt the eyes, either!  Well done.</td>', 'Love the balance, color and crop.  Jewel-like colors don''t hurt the eyes, either!  Well done.', '2003-05-19 21:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(302589, 21389, 8130, '<td valign="top">Great motion catch, I like the composition, those upright ears and enthusiasm of your subject!  The DOP seems right, too.</td>', 'Great motion catch, I like the composition, those upright ears and enthusiasm of your subject!  The DOP seems right, too.', '2003-05-19 21:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
