(302619, 21154, 7711, '<td valign="top">I feel the background is really too busy and the lighting is a bit too harsh with the highlights and shadows its creating  to really capture the detail of this flower. maybe a simpler background (a different angle on the flower?) or a shallower DOF to blur more of the background and keep attention on the flower.</td>', 'I feel the background is really too busy and the lighting is a bit too harsh with the highlights and shadows its creating  to really capture the detail of this flower. maybe a simpler background (a different angle on the flower?) or a shallower DOF to blur more of the background and keep attention on the flower.', '2003-05-19 22:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
