(302688, 21134, 811, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are simply wonderful, and the composition is great too.  It almost looks like a mad little man in the orange part in front center.</td>', 'The colors in this are simply wonderful, and the composition is great too.  It almost looks like a mad little man in the orange part in front center.', '2003-05-19 23:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(302690, 21409, 7067, '<td valign="top">Looks refreshing, but how does it taste? :-P  If it were me, I think I would have cropped a bit off at the top, say 20 pixels or so, to focus the picture more on the glass.  I''m not sure if I like the dark lower corners or not.  One one hand they add some depth to the image.  On the other, they attract my eyes away from the glass.</td>', 'Looks refreshing, but how does it taste? :-P  If it were me, I think I would have cropped a bit off at the top, say 20 pixels or so, to focus the picture more on the glass.  I''m not sure if I like the dark lower corners or not.  One one hand they add some depth to the image.  On the other, they attract my eyes away from the glass.', '2003-05-19 23:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(302691, 21246, 8295, '<td valign="top">i know that  this is all about the colors and not the bug, but this is awesome, and the colors are incredible.</td>', 'i know that  this is all about the colors and not the bug, but this is awesome, and the colors are incredible.', '2003-05-19 23:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
