(302696, 21492, 2792, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Like the unique angle.  However, I''m not to thrilled with the border and the close crop on the top.  Overall, nice job!  7</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Like the unique angle.  However, I''m not to thrilled with the border and the close crop on the top.  Overall, nice job!  7', '2003-05-19 23:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(302697, 20936, 7067, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is definitely an eye-catching shot.  I like the complimentary colour contrast between the flowers and the sky.  On my monitor, though, they appear more yellow and blue (which are primary) than orange and purple.  <br/> <br/>What intrigues me is that the horizon is curved.  Is that from the curvature of the Earth?  If so, I didn''t realise it was so easy to capture on camera.  Or is the curved horizon the result of this photo being taken on top of a hill?  Or is it due to some sort of optical aberration of the lens of your camera?</td>', 'Wow, this is definitely an eye-catching shot.  I like the complimentary colour contrast between the flowers and the sky.  On my monitor, though, they appear more yellow and blue (which are primary) than orange and purple.   What intrigues me is that the horizon is curved.  Is that from the curvature of the Earth?  If so, I didn''t realise it was so easy to capture on camera.  Or is the curved horizon the result of this photo being taken on top of a hill?  Or is it due to some sort of optical aberration of the lens of your camera?', '2003-05-19 23:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(302699, 21078, 2792, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Love the colors.  The textures are really good.  However, I wish it wasn''t so centered.  Overall, good job.  7 =-)</td>', 'Nicely done.  Love the colors.  The textures are really good.  However, I wish it wasn''t so centered.  Overall, good job.  7 =-)', '2003-05-19 23:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
