(302790, 21028, 7711, '<td valign="top">dsidwell has a great post in the forums about how to size your picture for the web. You might find it helps you when fixing your pictures for submission. The colours here are brilliant but the shot seems a bit overprocessed and is too small to really tell, sadly.</td>', 'dsidwell has a great post in the forums about how to size your picture for the web. You might find it helps you when fixing your pictures for submission. The colours here are brilliant but the shot seems a bit overprocessed and is too small to really tell, sadly.', '2003-05-20 03:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(302793, 21129, 7711, '<td valign="top">the waves in the green and the reflection of the drop make this shot. Borders a bit heavy, but it matches the black and shadows in the drop. nicely done if not a bit overprocessed since the drop''s highlights look jagged and artifacty.</td>', 'the waves in the green and the reflection of the drop make this shot. Borders a bit heavy, but it matches the black and shadows in the drop. nicely done if not a bit overprocessed since the drop''s highlights look jagged and artifacty.', '2003-05-20 03:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(302795, 21168, 7711, '<td valign="top">the crop seems a bit tight. I wouldn''t have minded more of the glass and a bit more of the bottle. Perhaps its the constraining border colour that bothers me..not sure, but the border for sure is too thick and not a colour that is bringing out the best in your picture.</td>', 'the crop seems a bit tight. I wouldn''t have minded more of the glass and a bit more of the bottle. Perhaps its the constraining border colour that bothers me..not sure, but the border for sure is too thick and not a colour that is bringing out the best in your picture.', '2003-05-20 03:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(302796, 21308, 7711, '<td valign="top">seems either underexposed or just plain dark. I like the textures though and the colours seem rich.</td>', 'seems either underexposed or just plain dark. I like the textures though and the colours seem rich.', '2003-05-20 03:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(302797, 21498, 7711, '<td valign="top">great textures, nice composition. I like the angle on the orange and the purple behind mirroring the curves of the fruit.</td>', 'great textures, nice composition. I like the angle on the orange and the purple behind mirroring the curves of the fruit.', '2003-05-20 03:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(302806, 21492, 3818, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the unusual perspective and creative use of color. The lighting and exposure and very good. Composition is nicely done as well, though a little tightly cropped around the top flower and at the bottome of the vase. Overall, a very successful image! Well done...~Renee</td>', 'I really enjoy the unusual perspective and creative use of color. The lighting and exposure and very good. Composition is nicely done as well, though a little tightly cropped around the top flower and at the bottome of the vase. Overall, a very successful image! Well done...~Renee', '2003-05-20 03:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(302808, 21424, 3818, '<td valign="top">Yeah...it''s a WOW shot! Great concept and execution...~Renee</td>', 'Yeah...it''s a WOW shot! Great concept and execution...~Renee', '2003-05-20 03:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(302811, 21320, 3818, '<td valign="top">Great stuff here...very creative and very well done. Looks like a digitally altered  image, but still very cool! ~Renee</td>', 'Great stuff here...very creative and very well done. Looks like a digitally altered  image, but still very cool! ~Renee', '2003-05-20 03:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(302813, 21251, 3818, '<td valign="top">No idea what the title means...this looks like some sort of bougainvillea, but it''s an interesting viewpoint and the tiny water bubbles are very good. Background digital manipulation looks a bit overdone and sharp line of petal agains the background is a bit too sharply defined. Use of negative space is good, but the bottom of the image lacks some oomph due to it''s being out of focus. Good effort...lots of potential here. ~Renee</td>', 'No idea what the title means...this looks like some sort of bougainvillea, but it''s an interesting viewpoint and the tiny water bubbles are very good. Background digital manipulation looks a bit overdone and sharp line of petal agains the background is a bit too sharply defined. Use of negative space is good, but the bottom of the image lacks some oomph due to it''s being out of focus. Good effort...lots of potential here. ~Renee', '2003-05-20 03:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(302815, 21403, 3818, '<td valign="top">Lots to like about this shot...focus is great, composition is interesting, focus is spot on, exposure is great...but...the colors do look a bit like the water washed them out! I''d love to see more color saturation and a little less sharpening, but a very good effort overall. ~Renee</td>', 'Lots to like about this shot...focus is great, composition is interesting, focus is spot on, exposure is great...but...the colors do look a bit like the water washed them out! I''d love to see more color saturation and a little less sharpening, but a very good effort overall. ~Renee', '2003-05-20 03:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(302817, 21392, 3818, '<td valign="top">Pretty yummy looking! Great water drops and colors are great! Only wish is for a tiny bit more depth of field, but everything else about it is absolutely mouth watering! ~Renee</td>', 'Pretty yummy looking! Great water drops and colors are great! Only wish is for a tiny bit more depth of field, but everything else about it is absolutely mouth watering! ~Renee', '2003-05-20 03:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
