(302950, 21499, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is very lovely.  The highligt in front and center does compete for attention with the subject though.  Outside of the challenge you can clone that out.  However for the challenge the best solution would likely be to crop. <br/>The subject is beautifully backlit...very nice!</td>', 'This is very lovely.  The highligt in front and center does compete for attention with the subject though.  Outside of the challenge you can clone that out.  However for the challenge the best solution would likely be to crop. The subject is beautifully backlit...very nice!', '2003-05-20 11:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(302954, 21392, 1280, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good, and the colors too.  Comp is good.</td>', 'The lighting is good, and the colors too.  Comp is good.', '2003-05-20 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(302964, 21445, 8488, '<td valign="top">Love it. If it were a little bigger (and therefore a little more detailed), it might have been a 9 or 10 for me; as it is, 8. :-&gt;</td>', 'Love it. If it were a little bigger (and therefore a little more detailed), it might have been a 9 or 10 for me; as it is, 8. :->', '2003-05-20 11:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(302965, 21396, 8488, '<td valign="top">I really don''t get how this applies to the theme at all, so I have to grade it down to leave room at the top for folks who *did* shoot to theme. Also, I find the pixelation/weave texture, as well as the overexposure and lack of middle tones, distracting.</td>', 'I really don''t get how this applies to the theme at all, so I have to grade it down to leave room at the top for folks who *did* shoot to theme. Also, I find the pixelation/weave texture, as well as the overexposure and lack of middle tones, distracting.', '2003-05-20 11:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(302966, 21313, 8488, '<td valign="top">The focus on the iris is a little muddy, and there''s no real center of attention for the photograph, to me - nothing to look at, for the picture to be about.</td>', 'The focus on the iris is a little muddy, and there''s no real center of attention for the photograph, to me - nothing to look at, for the picture to be about.', '2003-05-20 11:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(302971, 21448, 8488, '<td valign="top">It''s tight, dark, and overly, self-consciously precious, IMHO. I''d have sacrificed a little size for a bit more sharpness, and perhaps cropped away the distracting extra cheek on the left there. Well, that and added a bit more light. But that''s me. :-&gt; Also, I really don''t see how this fits the challenge, particularly, so I''m leaving room ahead of this in my marks for things that made the color central.</td>', 'It''s tight, dark, and overly, self-consciously precious, IMHO. I''d have sacrificed a little size for a bit more sharpness, and perhaps cropped away the distracting extra cheek on the left there. Well, that and added a bit more light. But that''s me. :-> Also, I really don''t see how this fits the challenge, particularly, so I''m leaving room ahead of this in my marks for things that made the color central.', '2003-05-20 11:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(302977, 21436, 1280, '<td valign="top">This stands out wonderfully from the dark bg.</td>', 'This stands out wonderfully from the dark bg.', '2003-05-20 11:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(303000, 21386, 8488, '<td valign="top">The pixelization and overprocessing distracts from the image, and the composition in general isn''t particularly interesting (no particular place the eye is directed).</td>', 'The pixelization and overprocessing distracts from the image, and the composition in general isn''t particularly interesting (no particular place the eye is directed).', '2003-05-20 12:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(303011, 21454, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Love the colors and the spot light effect with the dark shading around the subject. Very dramatic. Only thing I find is that the light is a bit too harsh on the flowers outside the vase. Very nice work.</td>', 'Excellent. Love the colors and the spot light effect with the dark shading around the subject. Very dramatic. Only thing I find is that the light is a bit too harsh on the flowers outside the vase. Very nice work.', '2003-05-20 12:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(303012, 21488, 7743, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh and the purple and orange flowers are competing since there is more than one center of interest.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh and the purple and orange flowers are competing since there is more than one center of interest.', '2003-05-20 12:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
