(303132, 20937, 8488, '<td valign="top">Lovely macro; good choice to have the entire flower sharp and the background fuzzed. Looks like something from a seed catalog, almost - advertising the plant or breed.</td>', 'Lovely macro; good choice to have the entire flower sharp and the background fuzzed. Looks like something from a seed catalog, almost - advertising the plant or breed.', '2003-05-20 14:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(303134, 21141, 8488, '<td valign="top">NICE crisp shot! I''ve shot frogs, and I know how tough it can be to get them to cooperate. Only the straightforward, almost journalistic style of composition keeps this a 9 from me instead of a 10 - if it had seemed more ''arty,'' as it were, if there were an emotional tone or a visceral reaction given (rather than just \"Oh, wow, what an outstanding photo of a bullfrog!"), I would have tenned it. Still, well done!</td>', 'NICE crisp shot! I''ve shot frogs, and I know how tough it can be to get them to cooperate. Only the straightforward, almost journalistic style of composition keeps this a 9 from me instead of a 10 - if it had seemed more ''arty,'' as it were, if there were an emotional tone or a visceral reaction given (rather than just \"Oh, wow, what an outstanding photo of a bullfrog!"), I would have tenned it. Still, well done!', '2003-05-20 14:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(303136, 21134, 8488, '<td valign="top">A truly ambitious concept, executed fairly well ... but I rated this 9 instead of 10 because the sheer muddle of all the vertical bars of color is mildly vertigo-inducing. Maybe a few more-defined stripes instead of so many tiny blades of colored grass (as it were) would have peaked at ''perfect'' for me. Or maybe not. Good shot, though!</td>', 'A truly ambitious concept, executed fairly well ... but I rated this 9 instead of 10 because the sheer muddle of all the vertical bars of color is mildly vertigo-inducing. Maybe a few more-defined stripes instead of so many tiny blades of colored grass (as it were) would have peaked at ''perfect'' for me. Or maybe not. Good shot, though!', '2003-05-20 14:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(303137, 21246, 8488, '<td valign="top">oh, WOW. Great macro. 9. I freely admit that the only reason it didn''t get a 10 from me is my own, personal, idiosyncratic preference for a slightly deeper DOF in this case - the blur sets in so soon that I start thinking I need to adjust my glasses.</td>', 'oh, WOW. Great macro. 9. I freely admit that the only reason it didn''t get a 10 from me is my own, personal, idiosyncratic preference for a slightly deeper DOF in this case - the blur sets in so soon that I start thinking I need to adjust my glasses.', '2003-05-20 14:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(303140, 21326, 8488, '<td valign="top">A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think.</td>', 'A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think.', '2003-05-20 15:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(303141, 21351, 8488, '<td valign="top">A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think.</td>', 'A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think.', '2003-05-20 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(303142, 21067, 8488, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for pansies. They have such lovely little faces! A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom, though yours is made more interesting by the addition of the second blossom to the side. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for pansies. They have such lovely little faces! A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom, though yours is made more interesting by the addition of the second blossom to the side. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think.', '2003-05-20 15:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(303143, 20972, 8488, '<td valign="top">Lovely concept, and very well-lit. 8. This could have gotten a 9 or 10 from me if it were better focused/sharper - as it is, the colors seem to define blotchy areas, instead of a solid shape.</td>', 'Lovely concept, and very well-lit. 8. This could have gotten a 9 or 10 from me if it were better focused/sharper - as it is, the colors seem to define blotchy areas, instead of a solid shape.', '2003-05-20 15:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(303144, 21419, 8488, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing particularly exciting in the frame, and the eye isn''t led to anything in particular. Decent try at the topic, and nothing blatantly *wrong* with the shot, but it doesn''t pop for me.</td>', 'There''s nothing particularly exciting in the frame, and the eye isn''t led to anything in particular. Decent try at the topic, and nothing blatantly *wrong* with the shot, but it doesn''t pop for me.', '2003-05-20 15:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(303145, 21073, 8488, '<td valign="top">A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; A little more contrast between the focal-point blossom and the background might have helped it pop a bit more.</td>', 'A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> A little more contrast between the focal-point blossom and the background might have helped it pop a bit more.', '2003-05-20 15:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(303149, 21261, 8488, '<td valign="top">A great concept, and technically I can point out no flaws; it''s a wonderful picture of a prettily-lit tulip. I can say the background bothers me for no reason I can articulate, and that it doesn''t seem particularly *exciting* (probably a composition thing), but it''s definitely a pretty photo, skilfully taken. 8.</td>', 'A great concept, and technically I can point out no flaws; it''s a wonderful picture of a prettily-lit tulip. I can say the background bothers me for no reason I can articulate, and that it doesn''t seem particularly *exciting* (probably a composition thing), but it''s definitely a pretty photo, skilfully taken. 8.', '2003-05-20 15:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(303152, 21233, 5364, '<td valign="top">I didn''t score this highly initially because I can''t see much in focus, but after a second look, I quite like the soft feel. The border however, I don''t like.<br/></td>', 'I didn''t score this highly initially because I can''t see much in focus, but after a second look, I quite like the soft feel. The border however, I don''t like.', '2003-05-20 15:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
