(303187, 21403, 5822, '<td valign="top">Terrific detail and the focus is right on. Great color... the purple is very vivid.  So life like I feel I could just reach in and pluck one!  If the image has any shortcoming, I believe it to be it''s composition. The right hand side of the photo bothers me slightly in that the green leaf stands in competition to the main flowers. . But all in all, this is my favorite image for this challenge and I gave it the highest score.</td>', 'Terrific detail and the focus is right on. Great color... the purple is very vivid.  So life like I feel I could just reach in and pluck one!  If the image has any shortcoming, I believe it to be it''s composition. The right hand side of the photo bothers me slightly in that the green leaf stands in competition to the main flowers. . But all in all, this is my favorite image for this challenge and I gave it the highest score.', '2003-05-20 15:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
