(303247, 21244, 7801, '<td valign="top">Good concept.</td>', 'Good concept.', '2003-05-20 16:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(303248, 21378, 8488, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing particularly exciting in the frame, and the eye isn''t led to anything in particular. Decent try at the topic, and nothing blatantly *wrong* with the shot, but it doesn''t pop for me.</td>', 'There''s nothing particularly exciting in the frame, and the eye isn''t led to anything in particular. Decent try at the topic, and nothing blatantly *wrong* with the shot, but it doesn''t pop for me.', '2003-05-20 16:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(303249, 21473, 8488, '<td valign="top">Good colors, decent lighting, but the composition is incredibly muddled, and there''s nowhere for the eye to alight and decide ''this is what the shot is about.''</td>', 'Good colors, decent lighting, but the composition is incredibly muddled, and there''s nowhere for the eye to alight and decide ''this is what the shot is about.''', '2003-05-20 16:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(303250, 21347, 7801, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, just a little small.</td>', 'Nice shot, just a little small.', '2003-05-20 16:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(303252, 21438, 8488, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition, but this picture doesn''t quite ''pop'' for me. Some combination of focus and lack-of-a-focus-of-attention, I suppose. It''s about the light-flare, of course, but once I''d looked at the bright spot and the rays and the pretty scallops in the rays, my eyes dropped onto the tree and kind of blinked at it, as if to ask, "Is this all there is?" 7.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition, but this picture doesn''t quite ''pop'' for me. Some combination of focus and lack-of-a-focus-of-attention, I suppose. It''s about the light-flare, of course, but once I''d looked at the bright spot and the rays and the pretty scallops in the rays, my eyes dropped onto the tree and kind of blinked at it, as if to ask, "Is this all there is?" 7.', '2003-05-20 16:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(303253, 21435, 8488, '<td valign="top">Decent colors, but this picture isn''t about anything in particular. Its composition feels accidental, haphazard, jumbled. The focus choices draw my eye to the ripples in the lettuce leaves, but then there''s nothing really to look at it in it.</td>', 'Decent colors, but this picture isn''t about anything in particular. Its composition feels accidental, haphazard, jumbled. The focus choices draw my eye to the ripples in the lettuce leaves, but then there''s nothing really to look at it in it.', '2003-05-20 16:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(303254, 21233, 7801, '<td valign="top">Like the framing and the soft feel.</td>', 'Like the framing and the soft feel.', '2003-05-20 16:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(303255, 21294, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and I also love the texture shown by the perfect focus.  9.</td>', 'I love the lighting and I also love the texture shown by the perfect focus.  9.', '2003-05-20 16:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(303259, 20945, 7801, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple and effective - not original though.</td>', 'Nice, simple and effective - not original though.', '2003-05-20 16:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(303260, 21320, 8488, '<td valign="top">This is abstract enough I can''t really tell what it is - and in past, I''ve sometimes found that to be a detraction, in my voting. However, this just strikes me, deep down, as so beautiful that I had to give it a 10 despite not knowing what you were photographing. :-&gt;</td>', 'This is abstract enough I can''t really tell what it is - and in past, I''ve sometimes found that to be a detraction, in my voting. However, this just strikes me, deep down, as so beautiful that I had to give it a 10 despite not knowing what you were photographing. :->', '2003-05-20 17:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(303261, 21025, 6520, '<td valign="top">Mine is going on eight so you get an 8</td>', 'Mine is going on eight so you get an 8', '2003-05-20 17:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(303263, 20976, 6520, '<td valign="top">great7</td>', 'great7', '2003-05-20 17:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(303264, 21110, 6520, '<td valign="top">nice but i bet its not all natural</td>', 'nice but i bet its not all natural', '2003-05-20 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(303265, 21432, 7801, '<td valign="top">Excellent - I love the foot on the right.</td>', 'Excellent - I love the foot on the right.', '2003-05-20 17:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(303266, 21067, 6520, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2003-05-20 17:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(303267, 21389, 6520, '<td valign="top">great shot looks like she is a hovercraft 8</td>', 'great shot looks like she is a hovercraft 8', '2003-05-20 17:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(303269, 21293, 6520, '<td valign="top">nice 6</td>', 'nice 6', '2003-05-20 17:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(303270, 21457, 6520, '<td valign="top">border is bad!!4</td>', 'border is bad!!4', '2003-05-20 17:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(303271, 21168, 6520, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2003-05-20 17:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(303272, 21434, 8488, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous crisp focus, and the lighting is just right to show the translucency. There''s no real central point in the composition or center of attention, but it''s pretty enough I''ll 9 it anyway. :-&gt;</td>', 'Gorgeous crisp focus, and the lighting is just right to show the translucency. There''s no real central point in the composition or center of attention, but it''s pretty enough I''ll 9 it anyway. :->', '2003-05-20 17:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(303273, 21294, 7778, '<td valign="top">I almost dismissed this shot as a representation of three kinds of rope, which would have made for a somewhat more ''pedestrian'' choice. Glad I clicked to view the real enlargement!<br/>Good, simple composition, captures the essentials to make the shot work.</td>', 'I almost dismissed this shot as a representation of three kinds of rope, which would have made for a somewhat more ''pedestrian'' choice. Glad I clicked to view the real enlargement!Good, simple composition, captures the essentials to make the shot work.', '2003-05-20 17:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(303274, 21468, 8488, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous rippling color (and I even like the rays in the upper left). There''s no real compositional center, or focus-of-attention spot, but it''s pretty enough I''ll 9 it anyway. :-&gt;</td>', 'Gorgeous rippling color (and I even like the rays in the upper left). There''s no real compositional center, or focus-of-attention spot, but it''s pretty enough I''ll 9 it anyway. :->', '2003-05-20 17:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(303276, 21409, 6520, '<td valign="top">8</td>', '8', '2003-05-20 17:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(303278, 21388, 8488, '<td valign="top">A very straightforward, down-the-throat macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think. My eye is drawn to the central, dark cavity, which is too dark and blurry to really hold attention.</td>', 'A very straightforward, down-the-throat macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think. My eye is drawn to the central, dark cavity, which is too dark and blurry to really hold attention.', '2003-05-20 17:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(303279, 21469, 8488, '<td valign="top">A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom (or, in this case, a cluster of buds). There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think. Nice tight focus, even down to defining those white granules, but there''s no one thing really to look at. If one of the pinkish buds were open, the single flower might well have given it the ''pop'' it needs.</td>', 'A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom (or, in this case, a cluster of buds). There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think. Nice tight focus, even down to defining those white granules, but there''s no one thing really to look at. If one of the pinkish buds were open, the single flower might well have given it the ''pop'' it needs.', '2003-05-20 17:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(303280, 21373, 8488, '<td valign="top">A very straightforward, side-on macro portrait shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt;</td>', 'A very straightforward, side-on macro portrait shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :->', '2003-05-20 17:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(303281, 21319, 8488, '<td valign="top">This would be a generic macro head-on shot of a flower, but the gutsy crop and nice focus and colors and lighting make it something a little special. 8.</td>', 'This would be a generic macro head-on shot of a flower, but the gutsy crop and nice focus and colors and lighting make it something a little special. 8.', '2003-05-20 17:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(303283, 21087, 8488, '<td valign="top">A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; Nice focus; slightly less extreme lighting might have helped bring out the blossom''s color (though if you''re shooting outdoors, I know you need to put up with what you''re given, lightingwise). It''s a good documentary photograph of that particular flower, or even the species, but nothing makes it particularly ''pop'' for me.</td>', 'A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> Nice focus; slightly less extreme lighting might have helped bring out the blossom''s color (though if you''re shooting outdoors, I know you need to put up with what you''re given, lightingwise). It''s a good documentary photograph of that particular flower, or even the species, but nothing makes it particularly ''pop'' for me.', '2003-05-20 17:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(303284, 21455, 8488, '<td valign="top">A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think.</td>', 'A very straightforward, head-on macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> Would make a good mousepad or coaster, I think.', '2003-05-20 17:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(303285, 21191, 8488, '<td valign="top">A fairly straightforward macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-&gt; Good color contrasts, dramatic lighting, good choice of focus. 8.</td>', 'A fairly straightforward macro shot of a blossom. There''s nothing that particularly excites me about it, but it''s executed in a very technically-proficient way, so I have to give props for that. :-> Good color contrasts, dramatic lighting, good choice of focus. 8.', '2003-05-20 17:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(303286, 21244, 8488, '<td valign="top">Great concept, good lighting, great focus and DOF. It makes one confront the reality of an everyday object in a way we might not have, before.</td>', 'Great concept, good lighting, great focus and DOF. It makes one confront the reality of an everyday object in a way we might not have, before.', '2003-05-20 17:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(303288, 21350, 8488, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and motion capture! Dramatic. Looks almost postcardy, except for the exact subject with the orange and the splash, of course. 8.</td>', 'Nice composition and motion capture! Dramatic. Looks almost postcardy, except for the exact subject with the orange and the splash, of course. 8.', '2003-05-20 17:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(303289, 21347, 8488, '<td valign="top">Great focus. The colors could be a little more saturated, and if it were bigger (and therefore more detailed), it might well have knocked my socks *entirely* off, instead of only partway. I do know how hard it is to get good, in-focus nature shots, though. 8.</td>', 'Great focus. The colors could be a little more saturated, and if it were bigger (and therefore more detailed), it might well have knocked my socks *entirely* off, instead of only partway. I do know how hard it is to get good, in-focus nature shots, though. 8.', '2003-05-20 17:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(303295, 20945, 7778, '<td valign="top">A ''pleasing'' photo, true to life and technically apt. The composition contributes something to an otherwise potentially ''mediocre''  subject and approach. Instead, because of such visible intricacies, I feel reminded of a certain bilogical matrix between all living things.</td>', 'A ''pleasing'' photo, true to life and technically apt. The composition contributes something to an otherwise potentially ''mediocre''  subject and approach. Instead, because of such visible intricacies, I feel reminded of a certain bilogical matrix between all living things.', '2003-05-20 17:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(303303, 21320, 8514, '<td valign="top">The colors, the composition,  the sharpness combine to make this an absolutely fabulous photo.</td>', 'The colors, the composition,  the sharpness combine to make this an absolutely fabulous photo.', '2003-05-20 18:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(303304, 21021, 8514, '<td valign="top">I really like the fluidity of the paint line and the blending of the colors.</td>', 'I really like the fluidity of the paint line and the blending of the colors.', '2003-05-20 18:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(303310, 21424, 6155, '<td valign="top">good work with the lighting effect</td>', 'good work with the lighting effect', '2003-05-20 18:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(303313, 21293, 6155, '<td valign="top">i think the couple ruin the shot</td>', 'i think the couple ruin the shot', '2003-05-20 18:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(303315, 21325, 6155, '<td valign="top">the heavy purple border is very distracting</td>', 'the heavy purple border is very distracting', '2003-05-20 18:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(303317, 21110, 6155, '<td valign="top">the mans head is distracting - 7</td>', 'the mans head is distracting - 7', '2003-05-20 18:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
